<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">Luqaasa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luqaasa Xaafeez Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggile</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luqaasa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luq.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luqaasa Xaafeez Yesuusa Kiristtoosa Wonggile</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesuusa dooreez taphpho nam77ii hawaaritay gancce Luqaasa baaya. Luqaasa Wonggilay, Yesuusa tiina nabitay doona ye7oda ginttinttii odintteez, Isreelitay kasepp naagttar yezay «Kiristtoosa» maaqqizannee as sheesh ubba ashshiza maaqqeeza beeziza. Luqaasa, fa maxaafayid Yesuusa, «Manqqitayis Wongile sabbakodayis» fa adaypp kiitintteeza maaqqeezannee ye Wonggilay asayis yez duma duma metopp kessizaya maaqqeezana odiza. Luqaasa Wonggile gancce, Yesuusa y7ithi baz odiz tiina shemppitayidannee Yesuusa fude salo kezeezaya odiz wurssithii shemppitay qoncce odintteezay ufayss bagga. Yesuusa salo kezeezaypp guye ammano wayizii dicceezakkonnee dalggeezako odiza taarika yha Wonggile xaafay hawaaritay ootho maxaafayid xaafeeza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiitanchchitay mazmuray bagga, Yesuusa yelintteez wode mehe heenggizitay yhanigii be7eezana odiza taarikay bagga, Yesuusa na7azar Xooss kara yhanigeezay bagga, keeha Samaare athay baggannee dhabii bentteez na7ay bagga odiza taarikay, Luqaasa Wonggile aaddayid benttiz taarike. Luqaasa Wonggilayid gaxapp gaxa hellodayis yez waanna qofay woosa bagga, Geeshsha Ayyana baz, Yesuusa ooso gancce maachchitayis yez aqonne Xoossii nagara maarizaya.</para>
  <para style="iot">Luqaasa Wonggilay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Aafe qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xammaqiza Waannisa Yesuusa yelinttonnee dico <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1:5—2:52</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xammaqiza Waannisa oosa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusa xammaqinttannee paacintto <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3:21—4:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusa Galila ootheez ooso <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4:14—9:50</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galilappe Yerusalaame hellodayis <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9:51—19:27</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurissith saamintta Yerusalaame heera <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 19:28-23:56">19:28—23:56</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yhayiqopp denddo, asis benttithinnee salo qito <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24:1-53</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Bonchcho Toofiloosa, nu gancce polintteez baza gaamitay, paasi danda7intteezay garkk xaafeeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Ye taarika u xaafeezay tiinapp aykkii aafe markkitayinnee qaala odii maaddizitay nuus odeeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Taakka ta baggar tiinapp akaakii be7eezaypp guye ye taarikay hana lo7ithii nees Toofiloosas xaafay taas lo77o maaqqii bentteeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Yeykka, ne tamaareez bazay tuma maaqqeeza erisodayissii. Xammaqiza Waannisa yelintto <verse eid="LUK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Yihuda kaat Herodoosa wode Abiya baggapp maaqqeez Zakkireesa giz Ayihude qeesay yeza. E machchatakka Aaroona sheeshippe. I sunthaykka Elssabeexo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 24:10">1 Zeena. 24:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Nam7aykka Goday wogannee azaza ubba naagii borso bayith Xooss tiina xillotithar yeziza. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Elssabeexa dhoonth maaqqeez gisho unttis na7a baaya. Nam7aykka cimeeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Pettii gallas Zakkireesa fa tarar Xooss tiina qeesetitha oothiza. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Qeesetith wogar Xooss kara gelii ixaannee cuyishshodayis eza ixa helleeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>E Ixaannee cuyshshodar asay bale eqqii woossiza.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Goday kiitanchchay yarshsho yarshshiza aqaypp ushachch baggar eqqii bentteeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Zakkireesa kiitanchchana bi7ii dagammii iita yashittii pokkeeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Zin kiitanchchay eziko, «Zakkireesa yashitippe; ne woosay sintteeza. Ne machchat Elssabeexa dhiirathi na7a yeloda, e sunthakka ne Waannisa goda. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>E nees ufayssi maaqqoda; gaamitay e yelinttayid ufayttoda. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Goday tiina E ubbaypp bayira maaqqoda; woyne ushshii maaqqin hara mathisiz ushshii uzhaamii. Fa indat ulo yezar Geeshsha Ayyanar kumoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">Tay. 6:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Isreele asitayipp gaamita u Goda Xoossayiko mahoda. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Aditay wozina na7itayiko mahoda, kiitinttoozita xillitay ecetithayiko mahodaygarkk, Godayis beeziza asa giigisodayis Eelaasa ayyarannee wolqqar Goday tiinar yhammada» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5-6">Mil. 4:5-6</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Zakkireesa kiitanchchayiko, «Ta yeya abar erodee? Taarannee ta machchatir cimeeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Kiitanchchay mahii, «Ta Xooss tiina eqqiza Gabreele. Yha mishiraachcha nees ododayis Xoossapp kiitintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:16">Daan. 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:21">9:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Yikkee, woday helin polinttiza ta qaala ne ammanaam ixxeez gisho yhayi polinttod hellodayis ne muume maaqqoda, odinttodayiskka danda7aamii» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Ye wode Zakkireesa Xooss kara gelii gam7eez gisho abi haneezako gi asay bale naagttar gam7eeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>E bale kezii unttar nashshodayis danda7ekkaya. Kusher mallii beezoppe attin odinttodayis danda7oozana bi7ii abukka be7eezaygarkk qoppeeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Zakkireesa yarshsho woda wurssii fa kara maaqqeeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Yeyppe guye, e machchat Elssabeexa wodexxeeza. Ichchin agina muume keethapp kezekkazar gam7eeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>Iza, «Goday fa maarotithayir ta borintta asay ganccepp qaarodayis koyii yhaya ootheeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa yelinttay tiinatii odintteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Elssabeexa wodexin usuppuntho aginar, Xoossii kiitanichcha Gabreelena Galila biitta yez Naazirete katama kiiteeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>Ezii wuddiritiko Dawute sheeshapp maaqqeez Yooseefa giz athayis ushintteez Mayiramiko kiittintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:18">Mat. 1:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Kiitanchchay iziko yhanigii, «Aadho keehatithar kumeezannee, saro nees maaqqo, Xooss neer yeza» yeeggeeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Mayrama e odayid iita dagammii, «Yhayi waafa sarotho» gi qoppeeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Kiitanchchay mahii, «Mayirame, yashittippe; ne Xooss tiina Saaba dengeeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Yikkee ne woddexxoda dhiirath na7a yeloda, e sunthakka Yesuusa gi sunthoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:21">Mat. 1:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>E gita maaqqoda, Ubbaypp Aadho Xooss na7a ginttinttii xeeginttoda. Xoossay E aday Dawute zufaana ees inggoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32-33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2 Sam. 7:12-13</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa. 9:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>E Yayqqooba sheeshal afa medhinas kawutoda; e kaatetithayis zawa baaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Mayirama kiitanchchayiko, «Ta dhiirath erooya Yeyi wayizii hanodayis danda7ee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Kiitanchchay mahii, «Geeshsha Ayyana neell afa wodhdhoda, Ubbap Aadho Xooss wolqqay neell afa kuyatoda. Yey gisho, yelinttiza na7ay geeshsh, Xooss Na7akka ginttinttoda. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Yikkee, ne dabbat Elssabeexa fa cimatith laythar dhiirathi na7a woddexxeeza. Iza dhoonth ginttintteezano, zin yhatte usuppuntha agina aykkeeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Xoossa gamizbaz baaya»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Medhe. 18:14</ref></char></note> yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Mayirama, «Yeezako, taas Goday ayllatis, ne qaalay garkk hano» yeegeeza. Yeyppe guye, kiitanchchay iippe shaakintteeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Mayirama ye saaminttate dendii Yihuda biitta yez pettii gezze katama yhanigeeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Zakkireesa kara gelii Elssabeexo sarotheeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Elssabeexa Mayiramii sarotha si7eezannii garkk I ulo yez na7ay ufayisar doonggeeza. Elssabeexa Geeshsha Ayyanar kumii, <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>fa qaala dhoqqi udii, «Neenii maachchitay gancceppe anjjintteezano, ne wodexeez na7aykka anjjintteezaya. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Hano zin, ta Goday indatee, ne taako ye7odayis ta oonoo? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Yeezako ne sarotha ta si7in ta ulo yez na7ay ufayisar doonggeeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Goday polod gi inggeez qaala ammaneezana, iza anjjitteezano» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mayramii Galata mazmuure</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Mayirama yhayigarkk yeegeeza:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Ta shemppata Goda bonchcheeza,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:46-55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1 Sam. 2:1-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>ta Ayyanay ta dhale Xoossal ufayttiza.<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>E fa ayllatii kawushshatitha be7eeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Yhayinope aykkii yeletithi ubbay tana anjjitteezano goda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 1:11">1 Sam. 1:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>Wolqqama maaqqeez E, taas dammabaz ootheeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">E sunthaykka Geeshsha.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Eza bonchchizitayil afa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">e maarotithay medhinapp medhina hellodayis yeziza.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Fa miinth qesayir fa wolqqa beezeeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">fa wozinar utirttizita laaleeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Wolqqanthiza kaatita u zufaanaypp wodhiseeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">fana toochcheezita dhoqqi udeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:11">Iyo. 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:19">12:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Nayintteezita lo77o bazar mishsheeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">durita kallo kushe dakkeeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Fa maarotitha qoppii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">Fa aylla Isreele maaddeeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>Yeykka nu aditayis odeez qaala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">Afraamesinnee e sheeshayis geezana medhinas polodayisii»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:7">Medhe. 17:7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 1:55">yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Mayirama Elssabeexi lanqqe hayidzii agina gam7ii fa kara maaqqeeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqiza Waannisa yelintto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Elssabeexis yelo qammay hellin dhiirath na7a yeleeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>I shooritaynnee I dabbitay Goday gaame maarotith ootheezana si7ii, izir wolla ufaytteeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Hosppuntha gallas duude na7ana dookalodayis ye7eeza. Na7ana aday sunthayir Zakkireesa gi xeegodayi koyeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:59 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lewii. 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Zin indat, «yey hannena Waannisa giinttinttodayis beeziza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Unttikka, «Ne dabbitaypp yha sunthayir xeegintteezay oonkka baaya» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>E aday oona gi sunth gaddodazako erodayis kozhii eza mallar oycceeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>E xaafiza baz oyccii ekkii, «E sunthay Waannisa» gi xaafeeza. Ubbay E xaafezana bi7ii malabaz geeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Izir Zakkireesa iranthay bilintteeza, Xooss galatittar odintto aykkeeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Shooritay ubbitay yashshar kumeeza. Yha haneezibazay Dhoqqi geez Yihuda gade ubbayid odintteeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Yeya si7eez ubbay, «Yha na7ay ab hanodeshsha» gi woli gancce odintteeza. Goday kushay ezar yeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zakkireesa tinbbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Waannisa aday Zakkireesa Geeshsha Ayyanar kumii yhay garkk yeegii tinbbite odeeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>«Isreele Goday Xoossay galatintto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">yi7ii fa asa wozeeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Fa ayllay Dawute kara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">atotithi kace dentheeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Yeykka binii wode geeshsh nabitay doonayid odintteezay garkk,<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>Ezii nuna nu morkkitayppennee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">nuur eqinttiza ubbitay kusheppe ashshoda.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Yeya E ootheezay nu aditayis fa maarotithi beezodaysinnee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">fa geesh caaqa naagodayis.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>Nu ada Afraames caaqqeez</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:73">caaqa qoppodaysinnee,<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>nu morkkitay kushepp kessii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">yashsha bayith eza oothoday garkkesii.<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>Nu layth ubbayid geeshshetitharannee xillotithar</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">fa tiina nuna essodayisii.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Ma ta na7ayyo, ne Ubbapp Aadho Xooss nabe ginttinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:76 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mil. 3:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">Godayis oge loythodayis ne e tiina yhammada.<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>Unttii atotith eretith demmadana, u nagaray atto ginttinttin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">ne Goday woyayis ododa.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Nu Xoossay fa keeha maarotithayir</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">wontta xalqqe nuus salopp kessoda.<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>Yeykka dhuma ganccennee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">yhayiqo kuya oommo yezitayis poo7isodayis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">nu tokakka saro ogeko mahoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 1:79">yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:79 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isa. 9:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Na7ayikka dicceeza, Ayyanarakka miinggeeza, Isreele asayis benttod gatho liizho demba yezeeza.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuus Kiristtoosa yelintto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat. 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Ye wode Oroome biitta yez as ubbitay taybinttod garkkennee sunthay xaafinttod garkk kaat Awugisxoosa azazeeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Yeykka Qerenoosa Soore biitta aqisiza wode haneez tiina woya tayiba. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Yey gishos, pettii pettii asii fa sunthi xaafisodayis fa yelintteez biitta yhanigeeza.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Yooseefakka Dawute karappennee kochchapp maaqqeez gishos Galila Naazirete katamapp denddii Dawute katama ginttiz Beeteleme yhanigeeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>E oyccii gaddeez wolqqa iita, Mayramir wolla xaafinttodayis Yhanigeeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Unttikka ezayid yezin iis yelo wode helleeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Fa bayra na7a yeleeza. Qanxxora xaaxii imathii aqiz aqo aqo dhabeez gishos mehe galla muziz goonna gancce woyitheeza.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mehe henggizitannee kiitanchchita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Ye gadayid qamma wude heenggitar qaa7el aqiz mehe heenggizitay yeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Goda kiitanchchay yi7ii unttis bentteeza. Goday bonchcho poo7ay u lanqqayir poo7eeza; unttikka wolqqama yashsha yashitteeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Kiitanchchay unttiko, «Yashittippatte! Yikkee as ubbayis maaqqeez gita ufayssa mishiraachcho ta ekkii ye7eeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Yeykka, Dawute katama ashshizay yinttis yhayino yelintteeza. E Goda Kiristtoosa. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Yeyisikka mallay yhaya. Xiqqa na7ay qanxor xaaxintt goonna gancce woyi7eezana yi demmada» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Qoppekkazin gaame salo kiitanchchitay kiitanchchayir wolla benttii, Xoossa galattittar,<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>«Bonchcho Xoossis dhoqqe salo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">saro biittal afa Xooss qadhdhiza asayis maaqqo» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Kiitanchchitay unttapp shaakinttii salo kezeezaypp guye mehe heenggizitay, «Ane Goday nuus qoncciseezi bazannee haneez baza be7adayis Beeteleme wolla yhammada» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Unttikka ellisii yhanigeeza. Mayiramo, Yooseefa, yeyppe xiqqa na7ay goonna gancce woyi7eeza denggeeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Bi7ii maaqqii na7ay bagga unttis odintteezana ye aqayid yez asayis geeshshii odeeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Yeya si7eez ubbay mehe heenggizitay odeez oda malabaz geeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Mayirama haneezibaza ubba fa wozinar qoppitar yeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Mehe heenggizitay unttis odintteezay garkk hanin be7eeza. Yey gisho, u fa si7eezibazisinnee be7eezi baz ubbayis Xoossa bonchchitarannee galatittar maaqqeeza.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusana Xooss kara kanggeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Hosppuntha gallas, dookalintodayis qamma hellin, eza wodexxodaypp tiina kiitanchchay gaddeez sunthayir Yesuusa gintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lewii. 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:3">Luq. 1:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Muse higgay garkk unttii shaagishe wode polintteezaypp guye Yoosefarannee Mayiramir na7a fa Godayis immadayis Yerusalaame yhanigeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22-24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:6-8">Lewii. 12:6-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>Yeykka, Goday higgayid, «Dhiirath maaqqeez bayra na7a ubbay Godayis shaakintteeza maaqqo» yeeginttii xaafintteezay polodayisii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Kes. 13:2</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Ma Goday higgayid, nam77ii hero woy holle geezay garkk yarshshodayis kanggeeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Ye wode geeshshinnee ammanor miinth maaqqeez Simoona ginttinttiz athay Yerusalaame yeza. E Isreelitay atotithi naagttar yeza. Geeshsha Ayyaanaykka ezal afa yeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Ma Xoossii dooreez Kiristtoosa be7ekkazar yhayqqaamana Geeshsha Ayyanay ees beezin erii yeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Eza ye gallas Ayyana kaalithin Xooss kara yhanigeeza. Na7a indatirannee adayir woga polodayis na7a Yesuusa ekkii geleez wode <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simoona mokkii ekkii na7ana idinggii, Xoossa galatitar.<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>«Godayyo ne taas geleez qaalay garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">yhatte ne aylla saro moyzoba.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Ta aafay as ubbay tiina ne giigiseez,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>ne atotitha be7eeza.<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Yeykka Ayihude baa as ubbayis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">Xooss tumatith beeziza poo7o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">ne asay Isra7eelitayiskka bonchcho»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 2:32">yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa. 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:10">52:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Yoosefarannee Mayramira e bagga odintteezana malabaz geeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Simoona unttan anjjeeza. Indat Mayiramiko, «Isreele yez gaamitayis u pokkithayisinnee denddayis Xoossapp doorintteeza. Ma ixxizitayis malla maaqqada <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Ne shemppayirakka azanno mashsha aadhoda» Yikkee gaame asay wozina geemmeez qofay benttoday garkk yeya geeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Ma Aseere kochchapp maaqqeez Faanu7ela na7ata Haanna ginttinttiz nabata yeza. Iza iita cimeeza; iza fa azinayir laappun laythi betteeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>I azinay yhayqqin hosppun tamannee oyddii laythi maaqqoda gatho qammannee gallas pacce bayith woosarannee xoomar Xooss Keetha oothiza. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Iza ye saatayid yhanigii Xoossa galateeza; Yerusalaame wozintta naagiza ubbayis na7ay bagga markkatteeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Yoosefarannee Mayiramira Goday higgayid azazintteez woga ubbita poleezaypp guye Galila biitta yez fa katama Naazirete maaqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 2:23">Mat. 2:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Na7ay diccittarannee ayyanar minggittar yhanigeeza. Ecetithar kumeeza; Xooss aadho keehetithay ezal afa yeza.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Xooss keetha yhanigeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Yoosefarannee Mayramir Faaziqa Baale bonchchodayis laythar laythar Yerusalaame yhanigiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kes. 12:1-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-8">Nam7i. 16:1-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Yesuusas taphpho nam77ii laythi maaqqiz wode kasepp oothizay garkk baala bonchchodayis yhanigeeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Baala bonchcheezaypp guye kara maaqqodar na7ay Yesuusa Yerusalaame atteeza. Zin Yoosefarannee Mayramir E Yerusalaame atteezana erekkaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>E kara maaqqiz asayir wolla yeza aazin unttii pettii gallasa oge yhanigeeza. E baazana ereezaypp guye fa dabbitayanee fa laggitay lanqqe koyeeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>E ezayid dhabin koyttar guye Yerusalaame hellodayis yhanigeeza.<verse eid="LUK 2:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Haaydzi gallasapp guye Xooss Keetha asitamaaritay gancce bettii u odizana si7ittarannee unttan oycittar yezin dengeeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Eza si7iz ubbitay e akaakannee e mahiz malssa malabaz geeza.<verse eid="LUK 2:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Kara asay eza dengeez wode yhay malabaz geeza. E indatakka, «Ta na7ayyo, abis nuna yhay garkk ootheenee? Ne adayirannee taar nena koyttar daabureeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Tana abis koyee? Ta, ta aday keetha yezodayis beezizana yi eroosa» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Zin E unttiko geezana unttii akaakekkaya.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Yeyppe guye, unttar wolla Naazirete katama yhanigeeza. Unttis kiitinttittar yezeeza. E indat ye ubbita fa wozina gaddii naageeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Yesuusa, ecetithar, eqamar, deetteer Xooss tiinannee as tiina dicceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:26">1 Sam. 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:4">Aazi. 3:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqiza Waannisa Sibikate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat. 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar. 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Wan. 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Kaatay Xibaaroosa Oroome biittal kawutin, taphpho ichchintho laythar, Phenxxe Philaaxoosa Yihuda aqisiza layithi Herodoosa Galila aqisiza layithi e isha Filphoosa Ixuurasannee Xirakkonddoosa aqisiza wode Lisanoosa Abilaanisana aqisiza wode <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Haannarannee Qayyaafara qeese halaqa maaqqii yezin, Xooss qaalay Zakkireesa na7a Waannisako liizho gadha ye7eeza. <figure style="fig" alt="High priest" file="HK00267B.tif" size="span" ref="3:2">Qeese halaqa</figure> <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Waannisa, «Yi nagaraypp maaqqoyttannee xammaqinttoytta. Xoossay yi nagara atto goda» yeegii tamaarssittar Yorddanoosa borkka heera yez biitta ubba yhanigeeza. <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Yeykka nabe Isiyaasa fa maxaafayid,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Isa. 40:3-5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Liizho gadha fa qaala dhoqqi udii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">uukkiza athay qaalay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">‹Godayis oge lo7ithoytta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">goossakka pidd udoytta.<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Loophpha ubbitay kumo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">ambaynnee deray ziqqii go.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Wobbo ogay luulo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">giigekka goossay qinxxii go.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Asho ma7eez as ubbitay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:6">Xoossii ashshizana bo7o› »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:6">gi xaafintteezay haneeza.<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Waannisa, e kusher xammaqinttodayis ye7eez gaame asayiko, «Yinttano, shooshii na7untho ye7odayis yez bochaypp buuttod garkk yinttan zoreezay oonoo?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat. 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Yikkee, yi maaqqitha beeziza lo77o ooso oothoytta, yi wozinar, ‹Nuus, nu aday Afiraame yeza gi gaayirppatte.› Yhana si7oytta, yha shuchchitaypp Xoossay Afraames na7a kessodays danda7iza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Wan. 8:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Yeezako, gande minxxayis xaphayid yeza. Yikkee, lo77o aafe aafowa mith ubbitay gachinttii tama gancce wodhdhoda» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mat. 7:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Asay, «Yeezin nuunii ab ootho?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Waannisa mahii, «Nam77ii afila yeza asii baazayis inggo. Katha yezay baazayis shago» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Qaraxe gachisizitay xammaqinttodayis yi7ii, «Asitamaarayyo, nu ab udo?» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:29">Luq. 7:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>E mahii, «Yinttan kiitteezanpp aathii ekkipate» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Ma wotaaddaritay yi7ii, «Nu abi udo» yeegii oyiceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Waannisa, «Obazikka wolqqar dafi ekkippate, oonakka worddor mootippate, yi damoozay yinttis gidoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Asay Kiristtoosa ufayisar naagttar yeza gisho Waannisa, «E Kiristtoosa maaqqadeshshaa?» yeegii u fa wozinayid qoppiza. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Waannisa ubbitayis mahii, «Taanii yinttan haathar xammaqiza, Zin taapp aadhii wolqqamizay ye7oda. Taanii e caammay wodora billodayis beezooya asii. E yinttan geeshsha Ayyanarannee tamar xammaqoda. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Wudumma yez katha geeshshodayis pithay e kushayid yeza. Geezheez katha fa shaalayid qoloda; bunnana dhaboowa tamar xuuggoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Ma Waannisa asa gaame zore zorii Wongile<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Wongile: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Girike doonar Wongile giz qaalay gaame ufayssiza oda woy mishiraachcho guussii. Ye mishiraachchaykka Kiristtoosa as kochchii ubba medhina pirddepp ashshodayis kiitinttii ye7eez gaame ufayssa (Luqa 1:19; 2:10)</char></note> sabbakeeza.<verse eid="LUK 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Zin Waannisa Herodoosa fa ishay machchat, Heroodiyada, ekkeez gishonnee hara iita oosita ootheez gishos kacceez wode<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19-20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3-4">Mat. 14:3-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17-18">Mar. 6:17-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Herodoosa kasesayil afa hara iita baz ubba gujjii Waannisana woyne geliseeza.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa xammaqintto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat. 1:1-17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Woyay ubbay xammaqqintteezaypp guye, Yesuusakka ma xammaqintteeza. E woossodar salo dooyintteeza, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>Geeshsha Ayyanay holle garkke maaqqii ezal afa wodhdheeza. Salopp «Taanii qadhdhiza na7ay nena; ne tana ufayssiza yeegiz» qaala ye7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Medhe. 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Maz. 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa. 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat. 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luq. 9:35</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa yeletith xuss</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat. 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Yesuusa taamarsso aykkiz wode ees hasttam laythi zini, asay eza Yooseefa na7a gi qoppeeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:23">Yooseefa Eele na7a, <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Eele Maate na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">Maate Lewe na7a, Lewe Milkka na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">Milkka Yoona na7a, Yoona Yooseefa na7a,<verse eid="LUK 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Yooseefa Mataate na7a, Mataate Amoxe na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">Amoxe Nahoome na7a, Nahoome Asiliime na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">Asiliime Naage na7a, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Naage Ma7aate na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">Ma7aate Mataatiye na7a, Mataatiye Samaye na7a,<verse eid="LUK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Samaye Yooseefa na7a, Yooseefa Yooda na7a,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:27">Yooda Yoonanne na7a, Yoonanne Rase na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">Rase Zerubaabela na7a, Zerubaabela Salatiyaale na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">Salatiyaale Neera na7a, <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Neera Milkka na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">Milkka Haade na7a, Haade Qoosame na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">Qoosame Elmodaannee na7a, Elmodaannee Eere na7a,<verse eid="LUK 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Eere Yoosee7e na7a, Yoosee7e Alaazara na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">Alaazare Yoorame na7a, Yoorame Maaxate na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">Maaxate Lewe na7a, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Lewe Simoone na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">Simoona Yihuda na7a, Yihuda Yooseefa na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">Yooseefa Yoonanne na7a, Yoonanne Eliyaaqeme na7a,<verse eid="LUK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Eliyaaqeme Maliyye na7a, Maliyye Maynaane na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">Maynaane Maaxate na7a, Maaxate Naatane na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">Naatane Dawute na7a, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Dawute Issaye na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">Issaye Iyobeede na7a, Iyobeede Boo7eeza na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">Boo7eeza Salmoona na7a, Salmoona Na7asoona na7a,<verse eid="LUK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Na7asoona Aminadaba na7a, Aminadaba Raame na7a, Raame Arnna na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">Arnne Asroome na7a, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Asroome Paarese na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Paarese Yihuda na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Yihuda Yayqqooba na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Yayqqooba Isaaqa na7a, Yisaaqa Afraame na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Afraame Taar na7a, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Taar Naakkore na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Naakkore Saruuge na7a, Saruuge Rehu na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Rehu Faalaqa na7a, Faalaqa Ebeera na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Ebeero Seela na7a, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Seela Qaynaame na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">Qaynaame Arfakisaada na7a, Arfakisaade Seeme na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">Seeme Nohe na7a, Nohe Laame na7a,<verse eid="LUK 3:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Laamehe Matusaala na7a, Matusaala Inooke na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">Heenooke Yaarede na7a, Yaarede Malali7eela na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">Malaal77ela Qaynaane na7a, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>Qaynaane Heenosa na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">Heenose Seete na7a, Seete Addaama na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">Addaama Xooss na7a.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa paacintteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat. 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar. 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Yesuusa geeshsha Ayyanar kumii Yorddanoose borkkapp maaqqodar Geeshsha Ayyanay eza liizho gadha kanggeeza. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Ezayid oyttam gallasinnee qamma xalaher paacintteeza. Ye gallasita abikka meekkazar gam7eez gishos wurssithal nayintteeza.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Xalahe eziko, «Ne Xooss na7a maaqqiko ane yha shuchcha soollo maaqqo gi azazoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Asii Xooss qaalarapp attin soollo aadda yezooya ginttinttii geeshsha maxaafayid xaafintteeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Nam7i. 8:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Yeypp guye, Xalahay Yesuusa adusse derell afa kessii yha alame kaatetititha ellissii beezeeza. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Xalahe, «Yha ubbitayill mawutennee bonchcho taas ingintteeza. Taanii qadhdheez ooskka inggiza gishos nees immada. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Yey gishos, neenii taas goynniko ubbitay nees maaqqoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Ne Goda, ne Xoossayis, aadda goynnoba, eza aadda aggazoba yeeginttii geeshsha maxaafayid xaafintteeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Nam7i. 6:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Wurssithal Xalahay Yesuusa Yerusalaame kanggii Xooss Keethis kusittel afa essii, «Neenii Xoossa na7a maaqqiko ane sulle sa7a guppii wodhdhoba. <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>Abis giiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">« ‹Nena naagiz fa Kiitanchchita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">Xoossay ne gishos kiittoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Maz. 91:11-12</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Ne tokay shuchchar dhubinttaamay garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">u fa kushayir nena denthoda› yeeginttii xaafintteeza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 4:11">yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Ne Goda Xoossa paaccippe ginttinttii Geeshsha maxaafayid xaafintteeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Nam7i. 6:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Xalahay Yesuusa paacita ubba wursseezaypp guye hara giiga wode demmad gatho ezipp shaakintteeza.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Galila ooso aykkeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat. 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mar. 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Yesuusa Geeshsha Ayyana wolqqar kumii Galila maaqqeeza. E waaray heera yez biitta ubbayil si7intteeza. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>E Ayihuditay Woosa keetha gelii taamarsseeza; asii ubbay eza galateeza.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Yeypp fa dicceez katama Naazirete ye7eeza. Tiin oothizay garkk maala gallas Ayihuditay Woosa keetha geleeza. Nabbabodayiskka denddeeza. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Nabe Isayaasa maxaafay ezis ingginttin, xaatha billii, yhay garkke yeegii xaafintteezana denggeeza:<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>«Goda Ayyanay taal afa yeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">manqqitayis Wongile odod garkk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">Xoossay tana tizheeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Acintteezitayis bilithi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">to7itay be7ad garkk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">un77intteezita bili7od garkk,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18-19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Isa. 61:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>Xoossay keehodayis qoppeez laytha odod garkk tana kiiteeza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 4:19">yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Yeypp guye, maxaafa xaaxii aggaazizayss inggii betteeza. Ayihuditay Woosa Keetha yeza asay ubbay dakkii be7eeza. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>E, «Yhayi yi hayer si7iz yha maxaafe qaalay yhayino polintteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Ubbitay e bagga lo77o odinttiza. Ma e doonapp keziz aadho keehatithar kumeez qaalar malabaz giittar, «Yhayi Yooseefa na7a baasanee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>E, unttiko « ‹Neno akimayyo nena ashshoba, yeegiz aaziso nashsha ta si7aamii yey garkk Qifirnahoome ne ootheez baz nu si7eezana ma yhaydda ne katamayid oothoba› » yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Maakka ta, «Tuma odiza; nabe fa yelintteez biitta bonchchinttooya yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Wan. 4:44</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>«Ta yinttis turo odiza; Nabe Eelaasa layth hayidzii laythinnee bagga salo gorddinttin iita naye biitta ubbayil yez wode gaame azinii baa maachitay Isreele yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Kaat. 17:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Eelaasa u ubbitayis kiitinttekkaya. Zin Seraptta gade yeza azinii baa pettii asitiko kiitintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1 Kaat. 17:8-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Nabe Elssa7e wode Isreele gaame borqqontto harger yez asay yeza. Zin Soore atha Ni7imaanepp attin oonkka geezhekkaya» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2 Kaat. 5:1-14</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Ayihuditay Woosa Keethi yez as ubbitay yeya si7eez wode gaame kacceeza. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Fa betteez aqaypp denddii ambal afa keexxintteez katamapp gaxa kessii urqqii dakkodayis amba xeera kanggeeza. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Zin E u ganccer aadhii qiteeza.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa tuna ayyana kesseeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mar. 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Ezaypp Galila biitta yez qifirnahoome katama yhanigeeza. Ezayid maala gallas asa taamarsseeza. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>E qaala tamaarssizay mawuter yez as garkk maaqqeez gishos ubbitay e timirtta malabaz geeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28-29">Mat. 7:28-29</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Maz. 91:11-12</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Ayihuditay Woosa Keetha tuna ayyana aykkeez athay yeza. Ezii fa qaala dhoqqissii ukkittar <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>«Naazirete Yesuusa nees nuur abi yenee? Nuupp haakkoba; ne ye7eezay nuna dhabisodayissonnee? Neenii oonazako taanii eriza. Neenii Xoossapp ye7eez xillaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Yesuusa tuna ayyaanaykko, «Si77e gi yha athaypp kezoba» yeegii kacceeza. Tuna ayyanay atha as ubbitay tiina shocii olii abikka qohekkazar ashshii kezeeza.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>As ubbitay malabaz gi. Woliko, «Hanos, yhayi aba timirtte? Tuna ayyanita mawuterannee wolqqar kiitiza; unttikka keziza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>E waaray heera ubbayil kezeeza.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa gaame harggintteez astta patheeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat. 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mar. 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Yeyppe guye, Yesuusa Ayihuditay Woosa keethappi kezii Simoona kara geleeza. Simoona machchat indat iita oxe misha harger hargintteeza. Izo pathoday garkk Yesuusa woosseeza. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>I hiixaykko shiiqii zuggii I hargga kacceeza. Mishay ashshin ellisii dendii unttan mokkeeza. <verse eid="LUK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Awa gelod hanodar duma duma harggayir aykintteez asa eziko ke7eeza. E pettayil pettayil afa fa kusha gaddii patheeza. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Tuna ayyanitay ma, «Neenii, Xooss na7a» yeegii ukkittar gaame asaypp kezeeza. Zin E unttan kacceeza. E Kiristtoosa maaqqizana unttii eriza gishos pettibazikka odod garkk koyekkaya.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Yihuda Ayihuditay woosa keetha taamarsseeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat. 4:23-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mar. 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Haga sa7a wonttodar Yesuusa pettii geema aqo yhanigeeza. Asay koyttar E yeza aqa ye7eeza. Unttapp E shaakinttii yhanggaam garkk eza woosseeza. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Zin E, «Taanii hara katamitayid yhanigii Xoossa kaatetithii Wongile markattodayis beeziza. Ta kiitintteezay yey gishosii» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Yihuda biittal yez Ayihuditay Woosa Keetha ubba wuttii sabbakeeza.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa dooreez tiina taamarita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat. 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar. 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Pettii gallas Yesuusa Gensareexe Abba lanqqe eqqeezin gaame asay e kantta ukkii urqqinttittar, E taamarssizana Xoossa qaala si7iza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:1-2">Mat. 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:9-10">Mar. 3:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1">4:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Ezayid abbay gaxa yez nam77ii wogolita be7eeza. Molo aykkiz asitay wogolitaypp wodhdhii fa gita meecciza. <figure style="fig" alt="Fisher men in their fishing boat" file="HK00208B.tif" size="span" ref="5:2">Molo aykkiz as</figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Ye wogolitaypp Simoonaare gelii biittapp xiqqal gedi abay ganccel shiishoday garkk oyceeza. Yeezii, ye wogolatayid bettii asa wongile taamarsseeza.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Fa tamaarssa wurisseezaypp guye Simoonako, «Gede ciimmayiko shiishii molo aykkodayis yi gita oloytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simoona mahii, «Asitamaarayyo, qamma muda daaburittar aqi abikka aykkekkaya, zin ne giiko neqaalayir gita nu oloda» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:3">Wan. 21:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>U gita oleez wode gitay peedhinttod gatho gaame molo aykkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:6">Wan. 21:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Hara wogolo gancce yez fa zhamitay yi7ii, fana maaddod garkk wuttii xeegeeza. U yi7ii nam77ii wogolita, haathay gancce mitinttod gatho molo kuntheeza.<verse eid="LUK 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Simoon Phixiroosa yeya be7eez wode Yesuusa tiina xuggunii, «Godayoo, taanii nagaranchcho as maaqqeez gishos taapp shaakinttoba» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Yeya E geezay ezinnee ezar yezitay aykkeez molay gaametithayir malabaz maaqqeez gishos. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Ma Simoona zhame maaqqeez Zabidoosa na7itay Yayqqoobarannee Waannisara malabaz geeza. Yesuusa Simoonako, «Yashittippe! Yhanpp neenii as aykkiz as maaqqoda» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>U wogolita gaxa shiisheezaypp guye ubbita ashshii Yesuusana kaalo aykkeeza.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa boriqontto hargger yezana geeshsheeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat. 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar. 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Yesuusa katamitaypp pettayid maaqqii yeezin pettii boriqontto harger<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Borqqontto hargge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Borqqontto harge asis gallal afa keziz harge. Isreele biitta boriqonttor yez yharggasitay hara asapp dummattii yezizapp attin as hellooyaa.</char></note> aykintteez asii ye katamayid yeza. Ye athay Yesuusa bi7ii e tiinayid xuggunii, «Godayyo, ne shene maaqqiko tana geeshshodayis ne danda7iza» gi woosseeza.<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Yesuusa fa kusha dakkii bochchii, «Ee, ta shene; geezhoba» yeegeeza. Izir athay geezheeza.<verse eid="LUK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Yesuusa, «Yhaya ooskka odippe, zin yhanigii nenatitha qeesa beezoba. Ne geezheezayis markka maaqqod garkk Muse kiitteez yarshshana yarshshoba» gi azazeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lewii. 14:1-32</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Maaqqozin, Yesuusa waaray kasepp aadhii dalggittar yhanigeeza. Gaame asay E odiza baz si7odaysinnee fa hargepp paxodayis yi7iza. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Zin ezii ubba wode fa aaddas geema aqo yhanigii woossiza.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa sila atha patheeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat. 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar. 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Pettii gallas Yesuusa tamaarssodar Galilappera Yihuda heera ubbaypp ma Yerusalaameppekka ye7eez Ferasaawitayira higge asitamaaritay ezayid betteeza. Asa pathiza Goday wolqqaykka ezar yeza. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Ye wode asay pettii sila as halar tookkii ke7eeza. Kara gelisii e tiinayid gaddodayis koyeeza. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Zin as darotithaypp kara gelsodayis gaminttii keethal afa kezii, siittingaa qawuxxii, harggintteez atha halar asa shagii Yesuusa tiina wotheeza.<verse eid="LUK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Yesuusa u ammana bi7ii, «Naat athayyo, ne nagaray atto ginttintteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Higge asitamaaritaynnee Ferisaawe asay, «Yhayi Xooss cazhizay oonoo? Pettii Xoossapp attin hara nagara atto godayiss danda7izay oonoo?» yeegii qoppeeza.<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Yesuusa u qofa ereez gishos unttiko, «Yi wozina gancce yey garkk abis qoppee? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>‹Ne nagaray ucintteeza gizayppenne dendii yedhdhoba gizayipp aayi lo77o?› <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Zin ta yeya geezay As Na7ay biittal afa nagara uccodayis mawute yezana yi erodgarkke.» Yeypp maaqqii, sila athayko, «Denddii; ne arssa tookkii ne kara yhanigoba» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>E ellithii denddii u tiina eqqeeza; E tookinttii ye7eez arisa tookkii Xoossa galatittar fa kara yhanigeeza. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Ye wode ubbitaykka malabaz geeza. Xoossa galatittar, «Yhayino nu damma malata be7eeza» yeegii yashitteeza.<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Lewa xeegeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat. 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar. 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa yeypp kezii yhanigittar. Lewe ginttinttiz pettii qaraxe gachisizay qaraxe gachisiza aqo betteezana bi7ii, «Tana kaalloba» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>E ubba baz ashshii denddii eza kaalleeza.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Ye Leway fa kara dammo sibire giigiseeza. Gaame qaraxe gachishizitayinnee hara asay katha maadayis betteeza. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Farasaawitayira higge asitamaaritay, «Qaraxe gachchisizitayrannee nagara oothizitayir abis mi uzhee?» yeegii Yesuusa tamaaritayir eza zigireeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1-2">Luq. 15:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Harggntteezttaypp attin pathi asis akime koshshooya. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Taanii nagara oothizitta maarotithiko mahodayispp attin geeshshita xeegodayis ye7ekkaya» yeegii maheeza.<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooma bagga shiiqeez oyich</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat. 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar. 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>U Yesuusako, «Waannisa tamaaritay gaame xoomiza, ma Ferisaawitay tamaaritaykka yey garkk oothiza. Zin neesitay ubba wode miizay uzhizay abiso» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Machcho ekkizay unttar yezin laazanthitay xoomoday garkk oothodayis danda7inee? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Zin machcho ekkizay unttapp shaakinttod gallas ye7oda, ye wode unttii xoomoda.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Ma yeegii aaziso odeeza; «Orothi ma7opp peedhii cima afilall afa sikkiza oonkka baaya. Yey garkk oothiko oroth afila per7iza, orothay cimayis giigooya. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Mal7antto woyine cima ogoro gancce buulliz oonkka baaya. Yeya oothiko, mal7antto woynay cima ogora dhuusiza; woynay laalinttiza ogoraykka adooya. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Yey gishos, mal7antto woyne orothi ogoro gancce buulinttodayis beeziza. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Yikkee, ka7eezay lo77o giz gishos ka7o woyne uzhii maaqqii mal7antto koyizay oonkka baaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Maala bagga oycintteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat. 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar. 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Pettii maala gallas Yesuusa gade ganccer aadhiza. Yesuusa tamaaritay bangga tizhzha duuthii fa kusher mirkkii miiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Nam7i. 23:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Zin Ferisaawitay ganccepp pettay pettay, «Maala gallas oothodayis nu higgayid beezoowa baz abis oothee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Yesuusa unttiko mahii, «Dawute nayintteez wode paar yezitayira wolla oothizana yi nabbabekkasa?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam. 21:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Xooss keetha gelii Ayihuditay qeesitay aaddas beeziza daabbo meeza; paar yezitaysikka inggeeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lewii. 24:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Ma Yesuusa, «As Na7ay maalas Goda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa kushe sila atha patheeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat. 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mar. 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Hara maala gallasi Yesuusa Ayihuditay Woosa keethi gelii taamarissiza. Ye aqayid ushachchi kushe sileez pettii asii yeza. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Higge asitamaaritayinnee Ferisaawe asay eza mootodayis sankke kozhii maala gallas pathiko be7ada gi naagiza. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Zin Yesuusa u qofa erii kushay sileez athayko, «dendii asay gancce eqqoba» yeegeeza, athaykka denddii eqqeeza.<verse eid="LUK 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Yesuusa, «An ta yinttan pettibaz oyiciza; maala gallas oothodayis beezizay lo77o bazonee iitabazo? Shemppo ashonnee dhabiso?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Ma Yesuusa e lanqqayir yez asa ubba yuuyii bi7ii athayiko, «Ne kusha piddi udoba» yeegeeza, athaykka E geezan garkk udin kushay paxeeza. <verse eid="LUK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Zin higge asitamaaritaynnee Ferisaawe asay iita yiladheeza. Yesuusal afa ab udo gi wolla tobbeeza.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa taphpho nam7i hawaarita dooreeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat. 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar. 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Ye wode gallasitaypp pettii gallas Yesuusa woossodayis derell afa kezeeza. Qamma muda Xoossa woossittar aqeeza. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Wonttitha fa taamarita xeegii u ganccepp taphpho nam7ita doorii, unttan, «Hawaarita» gi xeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Unttikka, Phixiroos gi xeegiz Simoona, e isha Indiraase, Yayqqooba, Waannisa, Filphoosa, Barttolomoosa, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Maatoosa, Toomaasa, Ilfoosa na7a Yayqqooba, fa biittayis micinttiz Simoona, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Yayqqooba na7a Yihudarannee Yesuusa aathii inggeez Asiqorontto Yihuda.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa tamaarssonnee patho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat. 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Yesuusa hawaaritayir wolla derellapp wodhdhii denba aqo eqqeeza. E tamaaritaypp gaamitay ye aqayid yeza. Yihuda biitta ubbapp Yerusalaameppe, Xiroosappennee Sidoona abba gaxapp gaame asay e taamarssiza baz si7odaysinnee fa hargepp faxodayisi ye7eeza. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Tuna ayyanar metinttiza asitaykka yi7ii paxeeza. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Pathiza Wolqqa ezipp kezii asii ubba pathiza gishos asay eza bochchodayis koyiza.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anjjonnee meto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat. 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Fa tamaaritayiko bi7ii yhaygarkke yeegeeza:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Yinttano, manqqitayyo, yi anjjintteezita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">Xooss kaatetithay yinttisii.<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Yi yhatti nayinttizitay anjjintteezita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">yi mizhoda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Yi yhatti yeekkizitay anjjintteezita</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">yi miiccoda.<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>Asay yinttan ta gisho, As Na7ay gishos</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">ixxiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">yinttan piliza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">yinttan u toochchiza wodennee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">iita sunthi u yinttis inggiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">yi anjjintteezita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:14">1 Phix. 4:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>«Yeezako, yi gatay salo damma maaqqeez gishos ye wode ufayisar guppoytta. Abis giiko, binii u aditay nabitayil afa yhay garkk udeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Zeena. 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Haw. O. 7:52</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>«Zin durttayyo yinttan ayye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">yi yhatti lo77o yessi ekkeezita.<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Yhatti mizheezitayyo yinttan ayye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">yi nayinttoda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Yhatti miiccizitayyo abo yinttanoshsho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">yi kayadhodannee yeekkoda.<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>Asii ubbay yi lo77otitha aadda odiz wode yinttan ayye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">U aditay binii worddo nabitayil afa yhay garkk ootheeza.<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Morkkita siiqo bagga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat. 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>«Zin tana si7iz yinttis ta odiza; yi morkkita siiqoytta; yinttan ixxizitayis lo77o baz oothoytta. <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>Yinttan baaddizita anjjoytta, yinttan naaqqizitayis woossoytta. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Pettii bagga shanggala baqqizitayis yhankko baggaka beezoba. Ne Koota ekkoda gizayis ne shaamizhakka gujjii inigoba. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Nena woossiza ubbayis inigoba; neeppi ekkeez oonakka maho gi oyccipp. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Asay yinttis oothod garkk yi koyiz baz ubba yinttikka asis oothoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:17">Mat. 7:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>«Yi yinttan qadhdhiza asa aadda qadhdhiko, aba galata yinttis yenee? Hara attozin, nagaranchchitayikka fana siiqizita siiqiza. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Yinttis lo77o baz oothizitayis aadda lo77o baz oothiko yinttis aba galata yenee? Nagaranchchittaykka yhay garkk oothiza. <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Tali7e mahod asis aadda yi tali7iko ab duma galatinttinee? Nagaranchchittaykka guye mahod asii bi7ii tali7iza.» <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>«Zin yi morkkita siiqoytta; unttis lo77o baz oothoytta. Guye ekkodayis qoppekkazar tali7oytta. Yeyid yi ekkod gatay damma maaqqoda. Yi Ubbaypp Aadho Xooss na7ita maaqqoda. E fana galatoozitayssinnee iititayiskka keeha. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Yi aday maariza maaqqeezay garkke yinttikka maarizita maaqqoytta.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hara asal afa pirddippate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>«Asal afa pirddippate; yinttal afa pirddinttamii. Yi borinttaamay garkk oonakka borippate. Atto goytta; Xoossay yinttis atto goda. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Inggoytta; yinttis inginttoda. Yi makkeez bazar yinttis maaqqii makinttoda, ubbarakka lo77o makkiz bazar baqqii, suuddii kunthii, laalinttodar yinttis makinttii inginttoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Maakka Yesuusa yeegii unttis aaziso odeeza; «To7ay to7a kaalithodayis danda7inee? Kaalithiko nam7itaykka woli ekkii gaga qitossannee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mat. 15:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Tamaaray asitamaaraypp aadhooya. Zin lo7ithii tamaareez athay fa asitamaaray garkk haniza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24-25">Mat. 10:24-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Wan. 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>Ne ishay aafayid yeza buuxa abis ne bi7inee? Ne aafayid yeza tuuss aazizana abis bo7oosaa? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Ne aafayid yeza tuuss aazizana be7ekkazar ne ishayiko, ‹Ta ishayyo ne aafayid yez buuxa kesso› godayis wayizii danda7ee? Neno cubbayyo, tiinattii ne aafayid yez tuuss aazizana kessoba. Yeypp guye, ne ishay aafayid yez buuxa kessodayis ne geeshsii be7ada.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mithinnee aafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>«Lo77o mithii iita aafe aafooya; yey garkkekka iita mithii lo77o aafe aafooya. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Aafe aafiz mith ubbay fa aafer erinttiza. Angguthapp Balase aafe maxinttoya ma gom7orepp woyne aafay maxinttoya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Mat. 12:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Lo77o as fa wozina gancce kumeez lo77o bazapp lo77o baz kessiza. Iita asii fa wozinayid kumeez iita bazapp iita baz kessiza. Asii fa wozina kumii fucceezaypp fa doonar odiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:34">12:34</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Keethe keexxiz nam7i asita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat. 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>«Ta gizana oothowazar, abis tana, ‹Godayyo, Godayyo, gee?› <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Taako yi7izayinnee ta qaala si7ii poliza ubbitay oona aazizako ta yinttan beessada. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>E keeth keexxodayis wodhisii, olla bookkii, oommo yez zaallayil afa keethi esseez eca atha aaziza. Di7o di77ii ye keetha urqqeeza, zin miinthii keexxeez gishos eni7odayis danda7ekkaya. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Zin ta qaala si7ii oothoozay fa keetha shafel afa keexxeez atha aaziza. Di7o di77ii ye keetha urqqeez wode ellis woddeeza. Ye keethay woddithikka wolqqama maaqqeeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Oroome mato halaqay ammano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat. 8:5-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:43-54">Wan. 4:43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Yesuusa yeya ubba as tiina tamaarssii wurisseezaypp guye, qifirnahooma katama yhanigeeza. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Ye aqayid pettii mato halaqay yeza. E gaame qadhdhiza ayllay hargginttii yhayiqos helleeza. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>E Yesuusa bagga si7eez wode fa aylla pathoday garkk eza woosso gi Ayihuditay cimita Yesuusako kiiteeza. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Kiitintteezitay, Yesuusako yhanigii, «Ne eesi yhaya oothodayis beeziza. <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Abis giiko, yha athay nu asa qaadhiza, Ayihuditayis Woosa Keethakka keexxeeza» gi miinthii woosseeza <verse eid="LUK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Yesuusakka unttar yhanigeeza. Mato halaqay karako ukkodar fa laggita eziko kiittii, «Godayyo, ta keethayid ne gelodayis taas beezekka gishos daaburippe. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Taakka tana ne tiina shiiqodayis beeziza as gi qoppooya. Zin ne yhan ize eqqii pettii qaala odoba; ta ayllay paxoda. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Taas taapp afar halaqay yeza, taapp oommor ta kiittiza wotaaddaritay yeza. Petta, ‹Qitoba› giiko qittiza, yhankka, ‹yhana ye7oba› giiko yi7iza. Ta aylliyakko, ‹Yhanno oothoba› giiko oothiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Yesuusa yeya si7eez wode malabaz geeza. Guye maaqqii yhanigii asayiko, «Ta yinttis turo odiza; hara attozin Isra7ele ganccekka yhay garkk gita ammano ta denggekka» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Kiitintteezitay kara maaqqadar ayllay paxin denggeeza.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Am7ati na7a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Wontitha gallas Yesuusa Nayine katama yhanigeeza. E tamaaritayirannee hara gaame asay ezar yhanigeeza. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>E katama gelod hanodar aha tookkeez gaame asay katamapp kezeeza. Yhayqqeez na7ay fa indatis petto, izakka am7o. Katama asaypp gaamitay izir yeza. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Goday izo bi7ii qadhinttii, «Yeekkippe» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Shiiqii hala bochchin tookkeez asay eqqeeza. Yesuusa, «Naat, yelagayyo denddoba» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Yhayqqeezay denddii bettii nashsha aykkeeza. Yesuusa na7a denthii indatis inggeeza.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>As ubbitay yashittii, «Ubbapp aadhiz nabe nu gancce denddeeza; Xoossay fa asita be7eeza» yeegii Xoossa galateeza. <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>E waaray Yihudaninne ye heerayid yez biitta ubbayil sintteeza.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusara xammaqiza Waannisara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-9">Mat. 11:2-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Xammaqiza Waannisa tamaarttay yeya ubbita Waannisas odeeza. E u ganccepp nam7ita xeegii, <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>«Ye7od giinttintteezay nenanee? Woy hara naago?» yeegii oycoytta gi Godayiko kiiteeza.<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Asay Yesuusako yhanigii, xammaqiza Waannisa, «Ye7od giinttintteezay Masay nenanee? Woy hara nu naago?» goytta gi nuna neeko kiiteeza yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Ye saatatte Yesuusa gaame asa hargepp patheeza. Tuna ayyanita kesseeza, gaame to7eez as aafitakka bi7iseeza. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Waannisa kanttapp kiitinttii ye7eezitayko, «Yhanigii yi be7eezanannee si7eezana Waannisas odoytta. Aafe to7itay bi7iza, gundditay bili7inttii yedhdhiza, borqqonttor yezitay geezhiza, tullitay si7iza, yhayqqeezittay yhayiqopp denddiza, manqqitayis Wongilay sabbakinttiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">Isa. 35:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Taal dhubinttowa oonkka anjjintteezaya.»<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Waannisa kiitteezitay yhanigeezaypp guye Yesuusa woyayis Waannisa baz yeegii odeeza: «Yi ab be7adayis liizho kezeene? Carkko eni7issiza maqa be7adayisonee? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Yeezin, ab be7adayis kezeene? Bonchcho afila ma7eez asa be7adayisinne? Bonchcho afila ma77ezitaynnee sa7a giigeez asay kaati keetha yeza. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Yeezin, ab be7adayis kezeene? Nabe be7adayisonee? Ee, ta yeegiza: yi be7adayis kezeezay nabepp aadhizana.<verse eid="LUK 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>«‹Ne oge ne tiina giigisiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">ta kiitanchcha neeppi tiina ta kiittoda›<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mil. 3:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 7:27">yeeginttii xaafintteezay yhayis ezissii. <verse eid="LUK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Ta yinttis odiza; maachchapp yelintteezitay ganccepp Waannisapp aadhizay baaya. Xooss kaatetititha ubbapp xiqqizay, E ubbappi damma maaqqoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Hara attozin, Yesuusa qaala si7eez qaraxe gachizitayinnee as ubbay Waannisa kushe xammaqqintteezitay Xoossay geesh maaqqiza qoncciseeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:32">Mat. 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luq. 3:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Zin farasaawitayinnee higge asitamaaritay Waannisa kushe xammaqinttaam ixxii Xooss qofa leqqeeza.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Yesuusa maaqqii yhay garkke yeegeeza: «Yikkee, yha wode yeletitha abar aazisode? Unttikka oona aazee? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Gabe gancce bettii woli xeegii, ‹Nu yinttis impillitte puggin, yi yexxooya. Nu sabbii zelalin, yi yeekkooya› yeegiz na7ita aaziza. <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Xammaqiza Waannisa soollo meekazarannee woyine uzhekazar yi7in, ‹Iita ayyanayir yeza yi geeza.› <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>As Na7ay miitarannee uzhittar yi7in, yha athay ‹Zhinbaraannee ushshii dosiza, qaraxe gachchisizitannee nagara oothizittay dabbo› geeza. <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Eccetithii turo maaqqizay fa na7atira erinttiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa shitto tizheez asito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Ferisaawitaypp Pettay Yesuusa katha muzodayis fa kara xeegeeza. E Ferisaaway kara yhanigii leematel afa betteeza. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Ye katama gancce pettii nagaranchcho maachchi yezana Yesuusa Ferisaaway kara sibirel afa yezana si7eez wode lo7ithii al7o albasxirosa bilggaaxe shitto ekkii ye7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37-38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:7">Mat. 26:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3">Mar. 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:3">Wan. 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Yesuusas guye baggar, e tokay kale eqqii yeekkittar e toka fa aafuthar laakitheeza. Fa binanayir e toka uccittarannee yeerittar shitto tizheeza.<verse eid="LUK 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Sibirana maakez Ferisaaway yeya bi7ii fa wozinar, «Yhayi nabe maaqqeezako yha asita eza bochchizanna oonazako ma iza waafa nagaranchcho maaqqeezako E erodazin» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Yesuusa, «Simoona, ta neesi odiza baz yeza» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">E, «Asitamaarayyo, taas odoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Yesuusa eziko, «Nam77ii asay peetii athaypp miishe tali7eeza. Pettay ichchin xeet dinnare yhankkay ma ishatam dinnare tali7eeza. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Nam7itaykka tali7e ciggodayis gaminttin, nam7tayiskka tali7eezana maareeza. Yikkee, yha nam7itaypp ye atha lo7ithii dosoday nees aaya aazee» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simoona, «Gaame aco maarintteez athay gaame qadhdhoda aaziza» yeegeeza. Yesuusa, «Ne tuma pirddeeza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Yeyppe guye, Yesuusa asttiko maaqqii bi7ii, Simoonako, «Yhanno astto ne bi7inee? Taanii ne kara gelin hara attin ne taas toke haath inggekkaya, Zin iza ta toka fa aafuthar laakithii fa binanayir ucceeza. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Ne tana yeerii ekkekkaya, Zin iza ta ne kara geleezaypp aykkii ta toke yeero ashshekkaya. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Neenii ta ommayil zayite tizhekkaya, Zin iza ta toka shitto tizheeza. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Iza tana gaame qadhdheez gishos I gaame nagaray atto ginttintteeza. E xiqqa nagaray atto giinttintteezay xiqqal qadhdheeza.»<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Yesuusa asitiko, «Ne nagaray atto ginttintteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Ezar wolla bettii miizitay, «Nagara atto yeegizay, E yhayi oonoo?» yeegii fa wozinar qoppeeza.<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Yesuusa asitiko, «Ne ammanay nena ashsheeza; saro qitoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa mokkeez maachitta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Yeyppe guye, Yesuusa Xoossa kaatetithii Wonggile sabbakittar katamarannee heerar aadheeza. Ye wode taphpho nam7itay ezar yeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>Ma tuna ayyaanappennee duma duma hargepp paxeez pettii pettii maachchitay ezar yeza. Unttikka, laappun tuna ayyanitay kezeez Magdeela Mayramo,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:55-56">Mat. 27:55-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:40-41">Mar. 15:40-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:49">Luq. 23:49</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Herodoosa shuumay Kuuza machchat Yohaanna, Soosinaranne ma hara gaamitay unttan miisher maaddizitay yeza.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zerth zeriz athay aaziso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat. 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar. 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Gaame asay duma duma katamappi eziko shiiqin aazisor unttis odeeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>«Pettii biitta oothii aqizay zerithi zerodayis kezeeza. E zerodar pettii pettii zerithay ogel wodhdhii yedhdhintteeza, salo kafitay meeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Yhankkitay sisinqqo oommor yeza biittal afa wodhdheeza. Haga doleezanii garkk biittay laako baazay gishos miicceeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Hara zerithay ma anggunthi gancce wodhdheeza. Agunthar wolla dicceez gishos angguthay cuullii aqayid ashsheeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Yhankkitay lo77o biittal afa wodhdheeza. Doleez wode xeet kushe aafeeza.» Yeya odii haasii, fa qaala dhoqqi udii, «Si7iz haye yeezii ubbitay si7o» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zerith aazisayis birshith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>E tamaarttay, «Yha aazisays birshshithay abba?» yeegii oycceeza <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>E, «Xoossa kaattetith xuura baz erod garkk yinttis ingintteeza. Zin hara asay bi7ittar denggaam garkk, si7ittar akaakam garkk aazisor odiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa. 6:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>«Yikkee, yha aazisays birshshithay yhay: zerithi yeegintteezay Xooss qaala. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Oge gaxa wodhdheez zerithay qaala si7izita. Maaqqozin, unttii ammanii attam garkk Xalahay qaala u wozinaypp maxii haasiza. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Sisilqqo yez biitta afa wodhdheez zerithay qaala si7ii ufayisar ekkizita. U yhattes ammanizapp attin xapho baa gishos paace helliza wode ellis kaddiza. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Aniguthi gancce zerintteezitay qaala si7izita. Unttikka alame qofar, duretitharannee sa7a yessi hanin cuulinttii beezizay garkk aafekkaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Lo77o biittal wodhdheez zerithay lo77onnee luule wozinar qaala si7ii naagizitannee danda7ar miinggii aafe aafizita.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xomppe Aaziso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mar. 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>«Xomppe xomppii, ota gancce woy arssapp oommor gaddizay baaya. Geliza asii be7ad garkk dhoqqe aqo gaddiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat. 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Luq. 11:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>«Yey gishos, qosintteezay pidhdhe kezekkazar, kamintteez baz, benttekkazar attaamii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat. 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luq. 12:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>«Yikkee, yi qaala wayizii si7izako naaginttoytta. Yeza ubbayis guzhinttii inginttoda, baazayis hara attozin ezis yeza xiqqatakka ezapp ekinttoda» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mat. 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luq. 19:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa indatirannee ishitayira</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat. 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar. 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Yesuusa indatirannee ishitayira eziko ye7eeza. Zin asitay gaametithaypp dendeezayid eza denggodayis danda7ekkaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Pettii asii Yesuusako, «Ne indatira ne ishitayira nena koyii bale naagiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Xooss qaala si7ii oosol peeshshizitay ubbay taas indonnee taas ishe» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa abba zulo seereeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat. 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar. 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Pettii gallas Yesuusarannee e tamaaritayira wolla wogolo gancce gelii, «Abba piinggoda» yeegeeza. Unttikka yhammadayis denddeeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Abbal afar unttii piinggodayis yhammadar Yesuusa gentteeza. Qoppekkazin wolqqama carkko abbal afa denddeeza. Haathay wogolo gancce gelin wogolay mitintto aykkin ubbay yashitteeza.<verse eid="LUK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>E tamaaritay eziko shiiqii, «Nu Godayyo, nu dhabooho yeegii» Yesuusa dentheeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesuusa denddii carkkannee gota seereeza. Ellisii carkkayinnee gotay hayizii cicirkki geeza. Sarotithaykka maaqqeeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaritayiko, «Yi ammanay aba yenee» yeegeeza. Unttikka, yashittitarannee malabaz giittar pettay pettayiko, «Carkkonnee haathii kiitinttizay, E yhayi oonoo» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuna ayyanapp paxeez atha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat. 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar. 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Abba piinggii Galila baggar yez Gerggesoone biitta helleeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Yesuusa wogolopp kezii sa7a wodhdhodar tuna ayyanar aykintteez athay katamttipp kezii eza helleeza. Gaame layth afila ma77ekkazar kallo duufo gancce yezaypp attin kara gelooya. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Yesuusana be7eez wode e tiinayid xuggunii, fa qaala dhoqqi udii, «Ubbapp Aadho Xooss na7a Yesuusa neer taas aba pettetithi yenee? Hayyana tana yhatti bixxisppe» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Yey E geezay, tuna ayyanay athaypp kezod garkk Yesuusa kacceez gishosi. Gaame wode tuna ayyanay eza mooddeez gishos santhalaaterannee toke acciz biraatar accinttii naaginttiza. Zin achcha duuthii tuna ayyanar laaginttii liizho geliza.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Yesuusa, «Ne sunthay oonoo?» yeegii oyceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">E, gaame tuna ayyanitay eza aykkeez gishos fana, «Leegona» geeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Tuna ayyanitay fana ciimmo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ciimmo guusay tuna ayyana wursith pirddess naaginttiza aqo</char></note> kiittaamgarkk woosseeza.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Ye aqayid derell afa miiz gudaylle wude heengginttiza. Yha guddayllitayll nu gelo gi woosseeza, ezikka «Geloytta» geeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Tuna ayyanitay athaypp kezii guddayllitayll geleeza. Wuday derellapp sulle gurgguxii abba gancce geleeza.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Heenggizitay haneezana bi7ii woxxii yhanigii, katamannee heera ubbayil odeeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Asay haneezibaza be7adayis kezii Yesuusako ye7eeza. Tuna ayyanay kezeez athay afila ma77ii, e wozinay maaqqin, Yesuusa toke kale betteezana denggii yashitteeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Eza be7eez asay tuna ayyanar aykintteez athay wayizii paxeezako odeeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Gerggesoone lanqqayid yeezii asay gaame yashsha yashittii Yesuusa fa gadaypp yhanigodgarkk woosseeza. E wogolo gancce gelii guye maaqqeeza.<verse eid="LUK 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Tuna ayyanay kezeez athay Yesuusar yezodayis woosseeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>Zin Yesuusa eziko, «Ne kara maaqqoba, Xoossay ab garkk dammabaz nees ootheezako odoba» yeegii moyizeeza. Athaykka Yesuusa ab garkk dammabaz ezis ootheezako katama ubbayid markkattittar qiteeza.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yhayqqeez na7atonnee Yesuusa afila bochcheez astto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat. 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar. 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Asay naagii gam7eez gishos Yesuusa maaqqiz wode mokki ekkeeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Ayihuditay Woosa Keethi halaqa maaqqeez Iyaroosa giz athay fa kara ye7odgarkk Yesuusa tokayil afa wodhdhii woosseeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>Ees taphpho nam7i laythi maaqqeez pettii maachchch na7a yezanna hariginttii yhayiqos hellii yeza. Yesuusa yhanigodar asay eza un77itheeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Taphpho nam77ii laythi suuthii goggittar gam7eez asita yeza. Iza paas yeezii shala ubba akimitayis inggii wurseeza. Zin paxodayis danda7ekkaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Iza Yesuusas guye baggar shiiqii, e afila manchchato bochcheeza, izira goggiz suuthay eqqii atteeza.<verse eid="LUK 8:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Yesuusa, «Tana bochcheezay oonoo?» yeegeeza. Ubbay «Nu bochchekkaya» yeegin, Phixiroosa, «Asitamaarayyo, gaame asay kaallodarannee urqqithodar bi7ittar wayizii, [‹Tana bochcheezay oonoo?› gee]» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Zin Yesuusa, «Pettii asii tana bochcheeza; abis giiko, wolqqa taapp kezeezay taas erintteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 8:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Ye asita, ibazi qosinttekkazana erii kukkurittar yi7ii Yesuusa tokayil afa wodhdheeza. Abis bochcheezakkonnee wayizii ellisii paxeezako as ubbitay tiina markkatteeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>E, «Ta na7ate, ne ammanay nena patheeza; saro qitoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Yesuusa nashsha wurssekkazin, Ayihuditay Woosa Keethi halaqay, Iyaroosa karapp pettii asii yi7ii, «Iyaroosa, ne na7ata yhayqqeeza; yikkee asitaamara cere daaburssippe» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Zin Yesuusa yeya si7ii Iyaroosako, «Yashittippe! Ammanobapp attin, ne na7ata paxoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Yesuusa Iyaroosa kara helleezan garkk Phixiroosa, Waannisa, Yayqqooba, na7atii adayppennee indattippe attin hara as gelod garkk koyekkaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Ye aqayid yez asay ubbitay na7atis woo woo gi yeekkodar, Yesuusa, «Yeekkippate! Na7ata gentteezapp attin yhayqqekkaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Asay na7ata yhayqqeezana eriza gishos e oda leqqii miiceeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Zin Yesuusa na7atii kusha aykkii, «Bushitte denddoba» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Na7atis shemppay maaqqin ellis puthuk gi denddii eqqeeza. Yesuusa unttiko, «Iziss miizibaz inggoytta» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Na7atii adayirannee indatir malabaz geeza. Zin Yesuusa yhaya, «Ooskka odippate» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa taphpho nam7i hawaarita kiiteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat. 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar. 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Yesuusa taphpho nam77ii hawaarita faako xeegii, tuna ayyanita kessod garkkennee harge ubba pathod garkk wolqqannee mawute inggeeza. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Xooss kaatetithii baz markkattod garkk hargintteezita pathod garkk kiiteeza. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>E unttiko, «Gufe maaqqin qurbo maaqqin katha maaqqin miishe maaqqin laammii ma77iza afila maaqqin oges gi abikka aykkippate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Luq. 10:4-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Ye katamapp yi kezod gatho imathettithar yi geleez aqo gam7oytta. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Oonkka yinttan mokaam ixxiko ye katamapp kezittar unttis erisiza markka maaqqod garkk yi toke yez buli7a pittii kezoytta.» <verse eid="LUK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Unttikka kiitintteezay garkk kezii Wonggile odittar duma duma heera hargintteezita pathittar aadheeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Heroodisa Yesuusa waara si7ii dagamo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat. 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar. 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Galila biitta aqisiza Herodoosa Yesuusa ootheez baz ubba si7ii dagameeza. Abis giiko, pettii pettii asay Waannisa yhayiqopp denddekka attenna yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mat. 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mar. 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Luq. 9:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Baggitay, «Eelaasa bentteeza» giza; yhankkitay ma, «Binii nabitaypp pettay yhayiqoppi denddeeza» yeegii odinttiza. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Zin Herodoosa, «Waannisa qoodhe ta gachisii wodheeza. Yeegin, yhay garkk yeeginttii e bagga odinttizay, E oonoo?» yeegii Yesuusana fa aafer be7adayis koyiza.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa ichchin mukule asita muzeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Wan. 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Taphpho nam77ii hawaaritay guye maaqqii yi7ii, unttii ootheez baz ubba Yesuusas odeeza. E unttan ekkii Beetesayida katamapp lanqqe yez aqo kanggeeza. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Zin gaame asay Yesuusa maaqqizana erii eza kaaleezaa. E unttan mokki ekkii Xooss kaatetith baz taamarsseeza; paxodayis koyizitaykka patheeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Sa7a omathodar taphpho nam77ii hawaaritay eziko shiiqii, «Nu yezay liizho maaqqeez gishos asay duma duma herarannee katamita yhanigii, kathannee aqiza kara koyod garkk asa moyzoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Zin Yesuusa, «Unttis miizibaz yi inggoytta» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Unttii, «Nuus yezay ichchin soollonnee nam77ii molo maaqqeez gishos yha asayis gidiza katha nuunii yhanigii wongaam ixxiko gidaamii» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Ye aqayid ichchin mukule maaqqiz dhiirathitay yeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesuusa fa tamaaritayiko, «Ishatam ishatam shaakkii shaakkii asa bettithoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>E tamaaritay, E kiitteezay garkk asita bettitheeza. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>E ichchin soollorannee nam7i molita ekkii, salo bi7ii, Xoossa galatii, menthii asa ubba helthod garkk fa tamaaritayis inggeeza. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Ubbay mi mizheeza. Unttapp atteez gufay taphpho nam77ii leemate kunth maaqqeeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phixiroosa, Yesuusa oonazako markkatteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat. 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mar. 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Yesuusa fa aadda woossodar, e tamaaritay eziko ye7eeza. Pettii gallas E, «Asay tana oona gee?» gi oyceeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Unttii mahii «Pettay pettay, ‹xamaaqiza Waannisa, baggitay Eelaasa, yhankkitay ma, binii nabitaypp pettay yhayiqopp denddeeza› yeegiza» gi maheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:1">Mat. 14:1</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-15">Mar. 6:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-8">Luq. 9:7-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>E mahii, «Yeezin yi tana oona gee» yeegeeza. Phixiroosa, «Neenii Xoossapp tizhintteez Kiristtoosa» yeegii maheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:20-28">Wan. 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mar. 8:30—9:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Yesuusa yhaya ooskka odippate gi miinthii odeeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa kaalo beeziza metonnee E yhayiqa odeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat. 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34-38">Mar. 8:34-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Maakka Yesuusa, «As Na7ay gaame meto ekkoda. Gade cimitayir, qeese halaqitayir, higge asitamaaritayir ixinttoda. Unttii eza wodhoda, zin E hayidzantho gallas yhayiqopp dendoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Yesuusa as ubbayiko, «Tana kaallodayis koyizay oonkka yeziko fana kado, fa maziqala gallas gallas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mazqale tookkii guusay: fa meto tookkii guusii.</char></note>tookkii tana kaallo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat. 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luq. 14:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Fa shemppato ashshodayis koyiz ubbay izo dhabisiza, fa shemppato ta gishos gi dhabisiza oonkka izo ashshiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat. 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luq. 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Wan. 12:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Asii alamel yeza baz ubba mooddii, fa shemppato dhabisiza baz woy qohiza baz maaqqiko eza ab maaddee? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Oonkka taalannee ta qaalayil yeellatiko As Na7ay fa bonchchor, fa aday bonchchayirannee Geesh kiitanchchitay bonchchor yi7iza wode e tiina yeellatoda. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Ta yinttis turo odiza; yhaydda eqqeezitay gancceppe Xoossa kaattetitha be7ekkazar yhayqqaam pettii pettii asay yeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa ciray laamintteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat. 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mar. 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Yesuusa ye oda odin, hosppun gallasapp guye Phixiroosa, Yayqqoobarannee Waannisa paar ekkii woossodayis derell afa kezeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28-35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2 Phix. 1:17-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>E woosal afa yeezin e ciray laamintteeza; afilaykka awa garkk focii booxii foceeza. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Nam77ii asay, unttikka Muserannee Eelaasara unttar nashshiza <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Bonchchor benttii Yerusalaame polinttodayis yeza baz, yeyikka, E yha alamaypp shaakinttod baz ezar odinttiza. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Phixiroosarannee ezar yezita gentta olin, u genttapp barkkii e bonchchannee ezar eqqeez nam77ii asita be7eeza. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Asay Yesuusapp shaakinttii qitod hanodar, Phixiroosa Yesuusako, «Godayyo, yhaydda yessi nuus lo77o! Petto nees, petto Muses, petto Eelaasas hayidzii gaabba gaabbisoda» yeegeeza. Zin E fa giz baz erooya.<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>E yeegii nashshodar shaara yi7ii unttan kammeeza. E tamaaritay ye shaaray gancce gelittar yashitteeza. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Shaaray gancceppe, «Ta dooreez na7ay yhaya eza si7oytta» yeegiz qaala sintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa. 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat. 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luq. 3:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Ye qaalay sintteezaypp guye Yesuusa fa aaddas yezar bentteeza. Ye gallas unttii be7eez baz ooskka odekkazar, fa wozina aykkii si77 gi atteeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa tuna ayyana pettii na7aypp kesseeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat. 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mar. 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Wonttitha unttii derellapp wodhdhodar gaame asay yi7ii eza helleeza. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Ye wode woyitaypp pettii asii ukkittar, «Asitamaarayyo, ta na7ay petto eza pathoday garkk ta nena woosiza. <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Tuna ayyana qoppekka aykkii uukkisiza; afapp olii gappunttisii qakitisiza, galla maduthisiz un77ithi dakkiza. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Ne tamaarttay kessod garkk woosseeza, zin u danda7ekkaya» yeegii woosseeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Yesuusa, «Ammano baa zhuca yeletithuntho, ayide hellodayis ta yinttar yezodee, ayide hellodayis yinttan danda7odee? Ne na7a yhana ekkii ye7oba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Na7a ekkii ye7odar tuna ayyanay shoccii olii kukkursseeza. Zin Yesuusa tuna ayyana kaccii na7aypp kessii patheeza. Na7anakka na7ay adayis inggeeza. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Asay ubbay Xoossayis yez dammo wolqqa bi7ii malabaz geeza. Unttii E ootheez bazar malabaz giittar, Yesuusa tamaaritayiko, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>«Yhaya ta yinttis odizana lo7ithii si7oytta; As Na7ay morkkitay kushe aadhii inginttoda» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Zin E geezbazay unttapp qosintteez gishos dhemelkk geeza. Yey gishos, mahii oyccodayis yashitteeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubbaypp aadho maaqqaday oonoo?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat. 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar. 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Yesuusa tamaarttay, «Nu gancce ubbapp aadho maaqqaday oonoo?» gi palama aykkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luq. 22:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Yesuusa u wozina qofa erii duude na7a fa kale essii, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>«Yha duude na7a ta sunthar mokkiza oonkka tana mokkiza, tana mokkizay tana azazeezana mokkiza, yi ubbaypp xiqqizay, e aadho maaqqada» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat. 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luq. 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Wan. 13:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Waanisa mahii «godayyo pettii athay ne sunthar xalahe kessodar nu be7eeza. Zin e nu bagga maaqqekka gishos nu eza kayeeza.»<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Yesuusa mahii «yinttan ixxowa ubbay yinttar yeza kayippate» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Samaare asay Yesuusana ixxeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Yesuusa salo yhanigiza woday ukkeez gishos Yerusalaame yhammadayis murttii denddeeza. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Samaare biitta yeezii pettii heera yhanigii, ubba baz ezis giigisoday garkk asa ye aqa kiiteeza. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Zin E yhanigizay Yerusalaame maaqqizana u eriza gishos mokki ekkekkaya. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Yesuusa tamaarttay Yayqqoobara Waannisara yeya bi7ii, «Godayyo, salopp tama wodhdhii unttan muye god garkk ne koyinee?» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:9-16">2 Kaat. 1:9-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Zin Yesuusa guye maaqqii unttan kaccii, Yinttal aba ayyana yezako yi erooya. [«Yinttal afa aba ayyana yenee. Yha qofay pettii pettii maxaafitayid baaya As Na7ay as ashshodayis ye7eezaypp attin dhabisodayis baaya»]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:55</char></note> yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Ezaypp denddii hara heera yhanigeeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa kaalo cigisiza gate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat. 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Yesuusara e tamaaritayira oger yhammadar, pettii asii, «Godayyo ne yhanigiza aqo ubba ta kaalloda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Shannitayis olla, salo kafitayis keethi yeza, zin As Na7ay fa omma shemppisiza aqo baaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Yhankkayikokka, «Neenii tana kaalloba» yeegeeza. Zin athay, «Godayyo, tiinatii yhanigii ta ta ada moogii ye7oda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Zin Yesuusa, «Yhayqqeezitay yhayqqeezita moogod garkk unttis ashshii ashshoba; neenii yhanigii Xoossa kaatetitha sabbakoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Ma hara asii, «Godayyo, ta nena kaalloda, zin tiinatii ta kara asa sarothi ye7oda» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:20">1 Kaat. 19:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Koxe aykkii guye bi7iz oonkka Xoossa kaatetithayis beezooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa laappun tamannee nam7i taamarita kiiteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Yeypp guye, Goday hara laappun tamannee nam7i<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Laappun tamannee nam7i: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pettii pettii maxaafitay laappun tam giza.</char></note> asita dooreeza. E yhammadayis qoppeez katamannee heera ubba tiinatii yhammad garkk nam7e nam7e udii kiiteeza. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Yikkee shiiqod torchche kathay gaame zin torchche ooso asay xiqqa. Yeeyeez gishos, torchche katha goday ooso asita kiittod garkk woossoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:37-38">Mat. 9:37-38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Yikkee, yhanigoytta, durttay garkk fugitay gancce yinttan ta dakkoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Mat. 10:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Yi yhanigttar oges yhayitita aykkippate, miishe maaqqin katha maaqqin caamma aykkippate. Ogell afa oonakka sarothar wode aathippatte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Mat. 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mar. 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Luq. 9:3-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Yi geliza keetha ubba tiinattii, ‹Saro yha keethayis maaqqo› yeegoytta. <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Saro qadhdhiza as ye aqayid yeziko, yi saray ezayid aqoda; ixxiko yi saray yinttis maaqqoda. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Ooso asis damooze beeziza gishos yi geleez keetha yinttis shiisheez baz ubba miittarannee uzhittar ezayid gam7oytta. Pettay karapp pettay kara yuuyppatte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 Qor. 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:8">1 Xim. 5:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Aba katamakka yi gelodar asay yinttan mokki, yinttis shiisheez baz ubba moytta. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>Ye katama gancce yez hargintteezita pathittar, ‹Xooss kaatetithay yinttiko ukkeeza› yeegii odoyitta. <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Zin pettii katama gelodar asay yinttan mokkaam ixxiko zoozel kezii yhaygarkke goytta:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Haw. O. 13:51</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>‹Nu tokayil afa yez yi katama buli7a pittoda, zin Xooss kaatetithay yinttiko ukkeezana eroytta›<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Mat. 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mar. 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Luq. 9:3-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Pirdda gallasar yha katamatipp Soodome katamas pirdday kawushsha maaqqadana ta yinttis odiza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Medhe. 19:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat. 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:24">11:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanoowa gishos borintteez katamita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat. 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>Ma maaqqikka, Yesuusa, «Neno Koraazinee, neno Beetesayda, ayye, yinttal oothintteez malatitay Xiroosannee Sidoona oosintteezako ezayid yez asay kayo afila ma77ii, budol afa bettii binii maaroteth gelii attodazin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Isa. 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-21">Iziqe. 26:1-21</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Iyu. 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo. 1:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zak. 9:2-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Yey gishos, yinttipp aathii Xiroosasinnee Sidoonas Xooss pirdday kawuzhoda. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Yhannee qifirnahoome, salo hellodayis ne dhoqqi geenee? Ne sulle Si7oole wodhdhoda» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Isa. 14:13-15</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>Maakka Yesuusa fa tamaaritayiko, «Yinttan si7izay tana si7iza, yinttan ekkozay tana ekkooya, tana ekkozay tana azazeezana ekkooya» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat. 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar. 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luq. 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Wan. 13:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laappun tamannee nam7itay maaqqeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Laappun tamannee nam77ii tamaaritay kiitintteez aqaypp lo7ithii ufayttitar maaqqeeza. Yesuusako shiiqii, «Godayyo, ne sunthar tuna ayyaanitayikka nuus kiitintteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Xalahe salopp dad garkk wodhdhodar ta be7eeza. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Yeezako, shooshinnee yhanigarcco yedhdhod garkkennee morkke wolqqar eqinttod garkk yinttis mawute inggeeza. Yinttan qohod baz akkokka baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 19:13">Maz. 19:13</ref></char></note> <figure style="fig" alt="Scorpion" file="BK00058B.tif" size="span" ref="10:19">Korne</figure> <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Maaqqozin, yi sunthay salo mazggabayid xaafintteez gishos ufayttoyttapp attin tuna ayyanitay yinttis kiitintteez gishos ufayttippatte» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fa ufayssa beezeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat. 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Ye wode Yesuusa geesha Ayyanar ufayttii, «Salo sa7a Godayyo, yha eccitayppennee eranchchitayppe qosii duude na7itayis beezeez gishos ta nena galatiza. Ee ta Adayyo, yeya ne oothodayis lo77o shene maaqqeeza.<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>«Ubba baz ta adaypp taas inggintteeza. Na7ay oonazako adaypp attin hara woy na7ay qonccisodayis koyizaypp hara oonkka ada erizay baaya» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Wan. 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Ma maaqqikka, Yesuusa duma fa tamaaritayiko, «Yi be7eezana bi7izitay anjjintteezita. <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Tuma gaame nabitayinnee kaatitay yi bi7izannee si7izana be7adayisinne si7odayis amotteeza, zin u be7ekkaya, si7ibe7ekkaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Keeha Samarawe atha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Yeezako, pettii gallas Muse higge eriza pettii athay denddii Yesuusa yeegii paace oych oyceeza. «Asitamaarayyo, medhinas de7o laattodayis taanii ab udo?» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25-28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:35-40">Mat. 22:35-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mar. 12:28-34</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Yesuusa, «Muse maxaafayid xaafintteezay waagee? Ne wayizii nabbabi akaakee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Athay mahii, « ‹Ne Goda ne Xoossa, ne kunthi wozinappe, ne kunith shemppopp, ne kunth wolqqapennee ne kunthi qofapp qadhdhoba. Maakka ne lagga ne ubbay garkk qadhdhoba› yeegiza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lewii. 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:5">Nam7i. 6:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Yesuusa eziko, «Neenii yinno likkee maheeza, neekka yhay garkk oothoba. Ne medhinas de7or yezoda» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lewii. 18:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Zin athay fana geeshsh oothodayis kozhii, «Hanos E ta laggay oonoo?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>E oychayis Yesuusa yeegii malsse inggeeza, «Pettii asii yezay Yerusalaame katamapp sulle Iyarkko katama yhammadar ogel afa paanitay kezii shoceeza. E afila qaarii ekkii yhayiqoppennee pathapp gancce ooilii qitteeza. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Guyepp, Ayihude qeese pettay ye ogayar fa yhamo yhanigttar atha bi7ii deshshi gi aadheeza. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Maakka pettii Leway ye aqa hellittar atha bi7ii hara oger aadhii qiteeza. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Zin, pettii Samaare biitta as yezay ye ogayar yi7ittar atha bi7ii ezis qadhintteeza<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33-34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:15">2 Zeena. 28:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Eziko shiiqii, e madothayil afa zayitennee woyine qoli acceeza. Fa harel afa betithi imathi aqiz keetha kanggeeza. Ye aqayid ezis koshshiza baz ubba ootheeza. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Wonttitha nam77ii diinaare mahii imathi kara adayis inggii, ‹Hayyana yha atha lo7ithii bo7oba. Taanii nees inggeezaypp afar ne kessiza baz ubbita ta nees ciggoda› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>«Yikkee, yha hayidzii asitaypp paannitay shoceez athayis laggee maaqqeezay nees oona aazee?»<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Athay mahii, «Ezis qadhintteezaya» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesuusa, «Neekka yhanigii yhay garkk oothoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Marttannee Mayramii kara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaritayir oge yhanigttar pettii heera helleeza. Ezayid Martta ginttinttiz pettii asita eza fa kara mokkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38-39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:1">Wan. 11:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Iziskka Mayramo giz mishshitta yeza, Mayrama qaala si7ittar Goday toke kale betteeza. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Zin Martta gaame oosor un77inttii Yesuusako shiiqii, «Godayyo, ta mishitta ooso ta aaddas ashshii bettii attin ta daaburodar ne bi7ittar si7ii ginee? Iza tana maaddod garkk odoosa» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Zin Goday yhay garkk gi maheeza, «Martta, Martta, ne gaamebazar tuurittar metinttiza. <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>Maaqqozin, koyinttizay pettibaz aadda. Mayrama lo77o baz dooreeza, yeykka izippe ekinttaamii» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa woosa bagga taamarsseeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat. 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Pettii gallas Yesuusa pettii aqo woossiza. Woosa wursseezaypp e tamaaritaypp pettay, «Godayyo, Waannisa fa taamarita woosa taamaarisseeza igarkk neekka nuna woosa tamaarssoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Yesuusa, «Yhay garkke yeegii woossoytta:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">«‹Salo yez nu adayyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">ne geesh sunthay anjjintto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">ne kaatetithay ye7o.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Nu gallasa katha yhayino yhayino nuus inggoba.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Nuna qoheezita nuunii atto gizay garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">nu nagara atto goba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">paace gancce nuna gelisippe› yeegoytta»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 11:4">yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Maaqqikka, Yesuusa fa tamaaritayiko yeegeeza: «Aazisos yinttipp pettayis laggee yeza. E giddii bilahe fa laggay kara yhanigii, ‹Ta laggayyo, hayidzii soollo taas tali7ooye. <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>Taas laggee maaqqeez pettii asii ogepp yi7in, ezis aathod baz tana dhabeeza› yeegiko,<verse eid="LUK 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>«E laggay keetha gancce yezii, ‹Hayyana tana waaythippe, pengay kobintteeza. Ta na7itaykka taar arssal afa woyi7eeza. Yey gishos, denddii ne koyeez baza inggodayis danda7ooya› yeeginene? <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Ta yinttis odiza; laggetithay gishos denddii immadayis koyekka maaqqikokka woosar wayitheez gishos denddii koyiz baz ubba inggiza.<verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>«Yey gishos, taanii yinttis odiza; woossoytta yinttis inginttoda; kozhoytta yi denggoda; bale yi7ii xeegoytta yinttis dooyinttoda. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Woossiza ubbay ekkiza; koyizay denggiza; bale yi7ii xeegizayis dooyinttoda.<verse eid="LUK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>«Yinttanno, aditayyo yi ganccepp na7a boora woosiko shuchchi ingizay oonoo? Molo woosiko shooshii ingizay oonoo? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Woy phuuphphule woosiko yhanigarcco ingginee? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Yi iitita maaqqittar yi na7itayis lo77o baz imo eriko, salo yez yi aday woossizitayis Geeshsha Ayyana wayizii aathii inggaamo?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusarannee Bi7elzebulara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Pettii gallas Yesuusa doona muumiseez tuna ayyana pettii athaypp kesseeza. Tuna ayyanay kezeezan garkk muume athay odintteeza. Woyaykka malabaz geeza. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Zin pettay pettay, «Tuna ayyana halaqa, Bi7elzebula wolqqar tuna ayyanita kessiza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat. 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Yhankkitay ma faaccodayis salopp malla beezodaygarkk koyeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat. 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1">16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mar. 8:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Zin Yesuusa u qofa erii unttiko, «Woli gancce shaginttiza kaatetithii ubbitay dhabiza; woli gancce shaginttiza keethi woddiza. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Xalahe kaatetithay shaakinttiko e kaatetithay wayizii miinggii eqqodee? Yi tana, ‹E tuna ayyanita Bi7elzebula wolqqar kessiza› giza. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Yikkee, taanii tuna ayyana Bi7elzebula wolqqar kessiza baz maaqqiko yinttan kaallizitay o wolqqar kessodeshsha? Yey gishos, unttii yinttal afa pirddizita maaqqoda. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Zin taanii tuna ayyanita Xooss wolqqar kessiza baz maaqqiko yikkee Xoossa kaatetithay yinttiko ukkeezana eroytta.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>«Miinth as danccinttii fa keetha naagiz maaqqiko, e shalay bochinttenna. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Hano zin, ezipp aadhii miinth maaqqeez as yi7ii, eza qohi gamii ammaninttii dancceez dancca bilisii, e shalana bonqqii shagiza.<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>«Taar wolla maaqqekkazay tana ixxiza; taar shiishozaykka laalliza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mar. 9:40</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuna ayyana bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>«Tuna ayyanay asappi kezeez wode shemppiza aqo koyii haathii baa aqor yuuyii. Shemppiza aqo dhabeez wode ‹Maaqqii ta kezeez karttee yhammada› yeegiza. <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>E maaqqiz wode keethay pitinttii lo77i yezin denggeeza. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Yeypp guye, yhanigii ezipp aadhii iiteez hara laappun tuna ayyanita ekkii yi7iza. Ezal gelii yess aykkiza. Ye athayis tiinaasaypp guyeesay aadhii iita maaqqiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Yesuusa yeya odal afa yezin pettii asita woya ganccepp dendii, fa qaala dhoqqi udii, «Nena tookkeez ulayinnee ne ammeez ammitay anjjintteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Zin E, «Anjjintteezitay Xooss qaala si7ii kiitinttizita» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoonasa malla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Gaame asay shiiqeez wode Yesuusa, «Yha yeletithay iita; malla koyiza. Zin Yoonasa mallitaypp attin hara unttis ingginttooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mat. 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mar. 8:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Yoonasa Nanawe asayis malla maaqqeezay garkk As Na7aykka yha yeletithayis malla maaqqada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:4">Wan. 3:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Kaatata Saaba pirdde gallas yha yeletithayira dendii pirddoda. Abis giiko, iza Solomone eccetitha si7odayis biitta gaxapp dendii ye7eeza. Yeezako Solomonepp aadhizay yhaydda yeza<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1 Kaat. 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Zeena. 9:1-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Nanawe asay pirdde gallas yha yeletithayira dendii unttal afa pirddoda. Abis giiko Yoonasa sibkkater maarotithi geleeza. Yeezako, Yoonasapp aadhizay yhaydda yeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:5">Wan. 3:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asetith poo7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>«Xomppe xomppii qoso aqo woy ota gancce gaddiza asii baaya. Asii poo7ana be7ad garkk dhoqqe aqo gaddiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat. 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mar. 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Luq. 8:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Ne galla ubbayis poo7ay ne aafa. Ne aafay lo77o maaqqiko, ne kunth gallay poo7iza. Ne aafay harggiko ne gallay ubbay dhumiza. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Yey gishos, ne gancce yez poo7ay dhumaam garkk naagiza. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Yikkee, ne kunth gallay poo7o maaqqiko, ne asetithayidakka hara dhuma aqo dhabiko, ne galla kunthay wazhzhii geez poo7o garkk maaqqiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Usuppun ayyita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat. 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mar. 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Yesuusa fa nashsha wurisseezan garkk pettii Ferisaaway paar katha maaday garkk xeegeeza. E ezar wolla gelii sibirel afa betteeza. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Ferisaaway Yesuusa katha maadaypp tiina kushe meeccekkaza bi7ii malabaz geeza.<verse eid="LUK 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Goday eziko, «Yinttii Ferisaawitay wanccasinnee keres afa bagga meecciza. Zin yi ganccay bonqqannee iitatithar kumeeza. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Yinttano, boozitayyo, bale bagga medhdheezay gancce medhdheez goday eza baasannee? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Zin wanccannee keree yezana manqqitayis inggoytta. Ye wode yinttis ubba baz geesh maaqqada.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>«Ferisaawitayyo yinttan ayye, sawopp, xalootepp, yey garkk bazipp asiraata kessiza. Zin xillotithinnee Xooss qadhe yinttar baaya. Yhankkita ashshekkazar yhayititakka oothodayis beeziza, zin yi ashsheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lewii. 27:30</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>«Ferisaawitayyo yinttan ayye, Ayihuditay Woosa Keetha bonchcho oyide, gabe gancce bonchcho sarotho yi dosiza.<verse eid="LUK 11:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>«Liilamii dhabin asay erekkazar afar yedhdhiz duufo aazizittayyo yinttan ayye» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Higge asitamaaray maaqqii, «Asitamaarayyo, ne yeya giittar nuna cazhiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Yesuusa, «Yinttano, higge asitamaaritayyo, yinttanakka ayye, asii tookkodayis danda7oowa deexo toofo toossiza, zin yinttii yi ubbas hara attozin biradhdhe xeerarakka bochchoyya.<verse eid="LUK 11:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>«Yi aditay wodhdheez nabitay duufa yi giigisiza gishos yinttan ayye. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Yikkee, yi aditay oosa minthodayis u wodhdheez nabitay duufa yi lo7ithiza gishos u iita oosayis yi markka. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Yey gishos, Xoossay fa ecetithar, ‹Nabitannee hawaarita ta yinttis kiittoda, zin yi baggita wodhoda; yhankkita bayi7oda› yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Yey gishos, yha yeletithitay alamay medhintteezayppe yhanno hellodayis laalintteez nabitay ubbitay suuthayis oyiccinttoda. <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>Aabeelapp aykkii yarshsho aqosinne Xooss Keethapp ganccer laalintteez Zakkireesa suuthay gishos yha yeletithay oyiccinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Medhe. 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20-21">2 Zeena. 24:20-21</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>«Higge asitamaaritayyo, yinttan ayye, eretithi qulppa yi kushe aykkeeza, zin yinttis gelooya yhankkitakka gelisooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Yesuusa yeypp yhammadayis kezodar higge asitamaaritaynnee Ferisaawitay ezar eqinttii oyichchar wayitheeza. <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>E doonapp keziz qaalar eza aykkodayis koyii yeya ootheeza.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Ayyana minthathonnee Ayye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat. 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Ye wode gaame mukuler taybinttiza asay wolalli afa yedhdhinttod gatho asii asal afa shiiqii yezin, Yesuusa fa tamaaritayiko, «Ferisaawitay irshshopp naaginitoytta. Yeyikka cubbotith.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:6">Mat. 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:15">Mar. 8:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Benttekka qosinttii, erinttekka kamintti attizibaz akkokka baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mar. 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Luq. 8:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Yikkee, yi dhuma odeezibazay ubbay poo7o si7inttoda, qol7a haye kalkkasheez baz woyas odinttoda.<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>«Ta bagguntho, ta odiza si7oytta; asho wodhizapp attin hara abikka oothodayis danda7oozittayis yashittippate. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Hano zin, yi yashittodayis beezizana ta yinttis beessada. Yeykka wodheezayppe guye Gaanname olodayis mawute yezayis ezis yashittooytta. Ee, tuma giza; ezis yashittooytta. <verse eid="LUK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>Ichchin suunnitay pettii santifess bayizinttoosannee? Hanopp attin unttapp pettatakka Xooss tiina doginttenna. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Hara attozin, yi ooma binanaykka payidinttii yeza. Yikkee, yashittippate; gaame suunnitaypp yi aadhiza.<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>«Ta odiza si7oytta; as tiina ta baz markkattiz ubbayis As Na7ay Xooss kiitanchchitay tiina markkottoda. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>As tiina tana kaddizana Xooss kiitanchchitay tiina ta eza kaddoda. <verse eid="LUK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>As Na7al afa leqo qaala odiz ubbitay maarotithi demmada, zin geeshsha Ayyana cazhizitay maarinttenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:32">Mat. 12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:29">Mar. 3:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>«Asii yinttan aykkii Ayihuditay Woosa Keetha, daynnitay tiinannee kaatitay tiina gooshichchiza wode ab ododazakonnee waagii mahodazako hirigipatte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">Mat. 10:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:11">Mar. 13:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:14-15">Luq. 21:14-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Ye wode yi odod baz geeshsha Ayyanay yinttan tamarssoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dure athay boozetith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Woyitaypp pettii asii Yesuusako yi7ii, «Ta ishay taas nu aday keekepp shaakkod garkk ezis odoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Naat athayyo, yinttal afa tana daynninnee keeke shaakkiz cima ootheezay oonoo?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Maakka Yesuusa, «As yessay shalo gaametithar baazay gishos yaare ashshii miinthii yinttan naagoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Maaqqikka aazisor, «Gaday gaame katha inggiz pettii dure athay yeza. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Ye athay, ‹Ta katha taanii shiishodayis aqo xiqqeez gishos ab ootho?› yeegii fa wozinar qoppeeza. <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Yhanppe yessada; tiin yeza shaalita hullii hara dalgge shaale keexxoda. Kathannee taas yeza baz ubba ezayid oloda. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Fa shemppatiko, ‹Ta shemppate, gaame laythis nees gidiza shalo shiisheeza. Yikkee, shempp mooba, uzhoba, ufayttoba› yeegoda.<verse eid="LUK 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>«Zin Xoossay, ‹Naat, boozo athayyo, yhayino qamma ne shemppata neepp ekinttiza. Yikkee, ne shiisheezay ooss maaqqode?› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>«Yey gishos, paas duretithii sa7all shiishiza asis, Xooss kale dure maaqqekka asis wurssithay yha athayisaygarkke» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Un77inttippatte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat. 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Yeyppe guye, Yesuusa fa tamaaritayiko, «Yikkee, ta odiza baz si7oytta, yi shemppos ab maadee yi gallas ab ma77odee yeegii un77inttippate. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Shemppo kathapp galla afilapp aadhiza. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Kafita bo7oytta zerooya, maxooya, shaalekka baaya. Zin Xoossay unttan muziza. Yi kafitaypp lo7ithii aadhiza. <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Hano zin, yinttipp un77inttii fa laythal afa pettii qamma gujjodayis danda7izay oonoo? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Yikkee, yha xiqqabaz oothodayis danda7oowa yi harabazis abis un77inttee? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>An fudhitay wayizii diccizako bo7oytta. Waayooya suqqooya. Hara attozin, Solomone paas yeezii bonchcho ubbayir unttapp pettay garkkekka ma77ii be7ekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Kaat. 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Zeena. 9:3-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Yinttano, ammano pacceezitayyo, yikkee, Xoossay yhayino benttii wontta tama gancce wodhdhod fudhita yhay garkke ma7isiko, yinttan wayizii aathii ma7isoosa? <verse eid="LUK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>Yey gishos, ab moshsha woy ab uzhoshsha gi yi wozinar un77inttippate. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Ye ubba Xoossa ammanoowa asay koyiza. Zin yi aday Xoossay yey ubbitay yinttis koshshizana eriza. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Ubbapp aathii Xooss kaattetitha kozhoytta yey ubbitay yinttis gujjii inginttoda.<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>«Yinttano, xiqqa woyitayyo, yi aday Xoossay kaattetitha yinttis immadayis e lo77o shene maaqqeeza yashittippate. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Yinttis yeza baz bayizii manqqitayis inggoytta. Kayzo ekkowa, bila moowa aqo, cimowa qurbo gancce, wuroowa shalana salo shiishoytta. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Yi wozinay yi shalay yeza aqo maaqqada.<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Barkkii naago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>«Yi xeessay danccintteeza, yi xomppay poo7eeza maaqqo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Mat. 25:1-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>Fa goday bossaypp maaqqad gatho barkkii naagizitay garkk, goday yi7ii xeegiz wode ellis dooyodayis giigeez asita aazoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:34-36">Mar. 13:34-36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Fa goday maaqqiz wode genttekkazar naagizitay anjjintteezita. Ta turo giza; goday haatar danccii leemmate lanqqayid bettithi mokkiza. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Goday giddii bilahe maaqqin woy wonttimaathe maaqqin yi7ii, yey garkk genttekazar naagodar denggiza ye ayllitay anjjintteezita. <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Zin yhaya eroytta; kayizo ayide ye7odazako kara aday erizako keethay bokinttamizin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39-40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:23-44">Mat. 24:23-44</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Yinttikka giigii naagoytta; As Na7ay yi qoppekka wode ye7oda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Phixiroosakka, «Godayyo yha aazisa nu aaddas odinenee as ubbaso?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Goday mahii, «Yikkee, katha muzodayis beeziza woder immad garkk goday fa ayllitayil afa shuumeez ammanthizaynnee wozinaamay oonoo? <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Goday maaqqodar yey garkk oothittar benttiz ayllay E anjjintteezaya <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Ta yinttis turo odiza; fa godayis yez shalo ubbayil afa E shuuminttoda. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Zin ye ayllay, ‹Ta goday ellithii ye7enna› yeegii fa wozinar qoppii, gadhinditannee gaachita yhadhdhiko, ma paas kozheez garkk miitarannee uzhittar mathiko, <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>ye ayllay goday E qoppekka gallasaninnee hirggekka wode ye7oda. Yi7ii eza gashichii, e anija ammanoowa asitayir oothoda.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>«Goday shenay garkk giigozayinnee e goday ab qadhdhizako erittar oothowa ayllay gaame garafinttoda. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Zin fa goday shena erekka attii garafinttodayis beezizana ootheezay xiqqal garafinttoda. Abis giiko gaame inggintteezaypp gaame koyinttiza, gaame hadara ekkeezayppekka gaame immad gi naaginttiza.»<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sarotithis baazin shaakinttosii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat. 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>«Taanii ye7eezay biittal afa tama aythodayis. Yhatti tamay aykkizako tana wayizii ufayssoddeshsha! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Hano zin, ta yhatti xammaqinttiza xinqqatay yeza. E polinttod gatho ta waafa un77inttodeshsha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:38">Mar. 10:38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Sa7all afa sarotithi ko7odayis ye7eeza yinttis aazinee? Yeya baaya, ta ye7eezay shaakkodayis. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Yhattepp aykkii woli gancce shaakintteez ichchin asay pettii keetha wolla yeza. Nam7ittay hayidzitayil afa, hayizitayikka nam7itayil afa, denddii shaakinttoda. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Aday na7ayil afa, na7aykka adayil afa, indat na7attil afa, na7ata indatil afa, azinnay indat na7ay machchatil afa, na7ay machchat azinnay indatil afa, dendii shaakinttoda.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mika. 7:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laythita malloba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat. 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Maakka asayiko, «Awa gelo baggar salo shaaratiza wode bi7ii, ellis, ‹Ira ye7oda› yi yeegiza, yey garkkekka haniza. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Sulle bagga carkko carkkiza wode ‹Sa7ay awoda› yi yeegiza, yey garkkekka haniza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Yinttano, cubbitayyo, Salobazinnee sa7abaz shaakkii erizin yha woda shaakkii eroday yinttan wayizii gameenee?<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>«Yeezin, yi ubbas abis tuma pirddoosa? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Ne morkkayir wolla dayina tiina eqqodayis yhanigittar ogel afa giigodayis koyii. Ne giigekka attiko gooshichchi daynna tiina nena kammada. Daynnay nena poolisees aathii immada. E nena woyne oloda. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Si7oytta, pettii bakkanna attekazin ciggi haassod gatho ne izipp kezaamizanno eroba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Nagarapp maaqqith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Ye wode Yesuusako asay yi7ii Galila asay yarsho yarshshodar unttan Philaaxoosa wodhii u suutha yarshor walakkeez baza odeeza. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>E yhay garkke yeegii maheeza; «Yeezin yha Galila asay yha iita yhayiqo yhayqqeez gishos Galila yez asii ubbapp aadho nagara oothiza aazinee? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Yeya baaya! Yinttikka maarotethar maaqqaam attiko, ubbitay yhay garkk dhaboda. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Woy ma Salihoome giz bessayid gimbbay woddii wodheez taphpho hosppun asay Yerusalaame yez asii ubbapp aadheez nagara oothiza aazinee? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Yeya baaya! Zin yinttikka maarotethar maaqqaam attiko ubbay yhay garkk dhaboda.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aafe aafowa balase mithato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Maakka Yesuusa yhay garkke gi aaziso odeeza: «Pettii athayis woyne gade tukintteez balase mithat yeza. E iippe aafe koyii yi7ii abikka denggekkaya. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Gade goday woyne ooso asayiko, ‹Aafe denggodayis koyii hayidzii laythi maaqqii maaqqii yi7ii abikka denggekkaya. Yey gishos, gachchii hali7isoba; abis biitta melisee?› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>«Zin ooso athay, ‹Godayyo, i gaxa oothii osha olod gatho haberes laythis ashshooyee. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Guye laythi aafiko lo77o, attiko gachchii ashshoba› » yeegii maheeza.<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zokko kuuna asita paxeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Yesuusa maala gallas Ayihuditay Woosa Keetha taamarissiza. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Ye bessayid taphpho hosppun laythi tuna ayyana zokko kuuniseez pettii asita yeza. Iza kuuneezay gishos luule eqqodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Yesuusa izo be7eez wode xeegii, «Yhan asitee, ne hargaypp paxeeza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Fa kusha Izil afa gaddin, iza eller luulii eqqeeza. Xoossakka galateeza.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Zin Ayihuditay Woosa keeth halaqay yilottii asayiko, «Ooso oothiz usuppun gallasitay yeza. Yey gishos, ye gallasitayid yi7ii paxoyttapp attin maala gallas baaya» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:9-10">Kes. 20:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13-14">Nam7i. 5:13-14</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Goday, «Cubbitayyo, yi ganccepp gemate woy hare maala gallas zadalopp billii haath ushshodayis kanggoozay oonoo? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Yeezin, yha asita Afraame na7a maaqqittar xalaher accinttii taphpho hosppun laythi kunth yezeezanis maala gallas billinttodayis beezoossa?» yeegii oycceeza.<verse eid="LUK 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>E yeya odeez wode eqinttizittay ubbitay yeellateeza. Zin as ubbay E ootheez malata ooso ubbayid ufaytteeza.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sannaficce aafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Yeyppe guye, Yesuusa yhay garkke yeegeeza, «Xooss kaatetithay ab aazinee? Izo abar aaziso? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Xooss kaatetithay pettii as fa gade gancce tukkeez sanaficce aafe garkke. Iza diccii damma mith maaqqeeza. Kafitay i shaqayil afa shemppeeza.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Ma, «Xooss kaattetitha abar aaziso? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Pettii asita gaame dhiillar walakkii munuqeez xiqqa irshsho aaziza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xunth penge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Yeyppe guye, Yesuusa Yerusalaame yhanigttar E aadhiz ogel yez katamitaydannee heera tamaarssittar aadheeza. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Pettii as Yesuusako, «Godayyo, attoday xiqqa as aaddanne?» yeegii oycceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesuusa unttiko, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>«Si7oytta, xunth penger gelodayis butitoytta. Gaamitay gelodayis koyiza zin unttis hanaamii. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Keethi goday denddii penge gorddezayppe guye ‹Nuus dooyooyee› yeegittar bale eqqii xeessi aykkoda. Zin E, ‹Yi oonazakonnee anapp ye7eezako ta erooya› gi mahoda. <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Ye wode yi, ‹Neer wolla meeza, uzheeza, nu denbaydakka ne taamarsseeza› yeegoda.<verse eid="LUK 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>«E mahii, ‹Yi oonazakonnee anapp ye7eezako ta erooya. Yinttano, iitta baz oothzitayyo taapp haakkoytta› yeegoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Maz. 6:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>Afraame, Isaaqa, Yayqqoobarannee nabita ubbita Xoossa kaatetithayid yi be7ada, zin yi bale wodhdhii attiko yinttis yeefonnee achch coonchii maaqqada. <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Asay awa kessappe, awa gelopp, pude baggapp sulle baggapp yi7ii Xooss kaatetititha munttal afa bettoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:11-12">Mat. 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:13">22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Yey gishos, guyeteezitaypp tiina maaqqoditay, tiineezitaypp guye maaqqoditay yeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mat. 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:16">20:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mar. 10:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Yerusalaames yeekkeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat. 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Ye wode Ferisaawitaypp pettay pettay yi7ii, «Herodossa nena wodhodayis koyiz gishos yha bessapp denddii qitoba» geeza.<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>E mahii, «Yhanigii, ye workkanitayis yeezako, ‹Yhayinonnee wontta tuna ayyanita kessoda, harggintteezitta pathoda, hayidzantho gallasar haasoda› yeegeeza goyitta. <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Hanopp attin, nabay Yerusalaamepp hara aqo yhayqqodayis beezooya. Yey gishos, yhayino, wonttanne wonttii peezhii ye bessa yhammadayis denddeeza.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>«Yerusalaame, Yerusalaame, nabita wodhizannee, neeko kiitintteezita shuchchar shocizannee, shugula fa na7ita fa qefaypp oommor shiishizay garkk ne na7ita ta ta shuphphaypp oommor aappun toke shiishodayis koyennee, zin yi ixxeeza geeza. <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Ta yinttis odiza; yi keethay kaysattoda. Goday sunthar yi7izay anjjintteezaya yi god gatho tana denggaamii» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Maz. 118:26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:5">Erim. 22:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa maala gallas pettii harggintteez atha patheez</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Maala gallas Yesuusa pettii Farasaawitay halaqay kara katha maadayis gelodar asay e ab udizak be7adayi naagiza. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Ye aqayid shawuhe harger metinttiza pettii as ezis tiina baggar woyi7eeza. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Yesuusa Ferisaawutayikonnee higge asitamaaritayiko, «maala gallas harggintteez as pathizay woganee woga baasa?» yeegii oycceeza. <verse eid="LUK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>U si77 ateeza. Yesuusa hargginttiza atha bochchii pathi moyzeeza.<verse eid="LUK 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>«Maakka yinttipp pettayis na7a woy gemate maala gallas hoobbo wodhdhiko ellisii kessoozay oonoo»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:11">Mat. 12:11</ref></char></note> yeegii oycceeza. <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>U pettibazikka mahodayis danda7ekkaya.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Keehetithinnee imath moko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Yesuusa imatos xeegintteezitay bonchcho aqo doorodar bi7ii, yha aazisa odeeza: <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>«Pettii asii nena bossas xeegiko bonchcho aqo bettippe. Neepp aadhii bonchchinttiza asii xeeginttodayis danda7iza. <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>Yinttan nam7itakka xeegeezay yi7ii, ‹Ne aqa yha imathayis dakkoba› yeegiz wode ne yeellatittar sull wodhdhada. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Maaqqozin, ne xeegintteez wode tiinattii ziqqa aqo bi7ii bettoba. Xeegeezay yi7ii, ‹Ta laggayyo, yha bonchcho aqayid bettoba› yeegoda. Ye wode neer wolla xeegintteez asa ubbay tiina ne bonchchinttoda. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Fana shokk shokk udiz ubbitay kawuzhoda; fana ziqq ziqq udiz ubbitay shokk shokk goda.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat. 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">Luq. 18:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Maakka Yesuusa eza mokkeez kara adayiko, «Quma woy kaho imato xeegiz wode neenii kushe maho xeegaamay garkk ne laggita woy ne ishita woy ne dabbita woy ne dure shoorita imato xeegippe. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Maaqqozin, ne imato makkeez wode manqqita, wobbita, silitannee to7ita xeegoba; ne anjjinttoda. <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>Yhayititay kushe mahodayis danda7oowa gishos kushe mahithay geeshshitay denddo gallas Xooss nees mahoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Damma imato aaziso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat. 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Yesuusar wolla imatol afa betteezitay gancceppe pettay yeya si7ii, «Xoossa kaatetithayid imatol afa betteezay anjjintteezaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Yesuusa, «Pettii as damma imato giigisii gaame asita xeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Imato mokinttiza saatat helliz wode xeegintteez imathita, ‹Yeezako ubba baz giigeeza, yhana ye7oytta› yeegii xeegod garkk fa aylla azazeeza.<verse eid="LUK 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>«Zin ubbitaykka fa salambe salambe medhdheeza. Pettay, ‹Yhatti ta haga gade wonggeez gishos yhanigii be7adayis koshshiza hayyana tana ashshooyee› yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Yhankkay, ‹Ichchin waaxa gemate wonggeeza unttan waaxii faacii be7ad gishos hayyana taal lanccippe› yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Ma yhankkay, ‹Taanii haga meddal yez gishos ye7odayis danda7inttaamii› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>«Ayllay maaqqii yi7ii yeya ubba fa godayis odeeza. Ye wode boss goday kaccinttii ayllayiko, ‹Ellis katama yez goossitayillane husa ogitayill yhanigii, manqqita, wobbita, to7itannee gunddeezita yhana ko7oba› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>«Ayllay, ‹Ta godayyo, ne kiiteezay ubbitay polintteeza, zin yhattekka aqo yeza› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>«Goday ayllayiko, ‹Goositayil afannee, kara gancce ogell kezoba, ta keethay kumod gatho bentteez ubbitay ye7od garkk udoba. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Ta yinttis odiza; imatinttii atteezitaypp oonkka ta ataalaypp maamizana eroytta› geeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Goda kaalo cigisiza gate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Gaame asay ezar wolla yhammadar Yesuusa unttiko guye maaqqii, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>«Taako yi7iz ubbitay fa adannee fa indo, fa machchattonnee fa na7ita, fa ishitannee fa mishita, hara attozin fa shemppo ixxoozay ta tamaare maaqqodayis danda7ooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mat. 10:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Fa mazqale tookkii tana kaallowa oonkka ta tamaare maaqqodayis danda7ooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:13">Mat. 10:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24">16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mar. 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Luq. 9:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>«Yinttipp pettii asii shuchch keeth keexxodayis koyiko, keeth keexxii wurssodayis ab garkk miishe koshshizako tiinattii erodayis qoppozay oonoo? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Yeya maaqqekka attiko, yha athay baasol shuchchi hiixxin wursso gamiko, <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>bi7iza ubbay, ‹Yha athay gimbbithi aykkin wurssodayis eza gameeza› yeegii boriza.<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>«Woy pettii kaatay hara kaatar olinttodayis denddittar laatam mukule olanchchita ekkii ye besa kaatayir taphphii mukule olanchchitar eqinttodayis danda7odanannee danda7aamiza tiinattii bettii zorinttoozay oonoo? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Eqinttodayis danda7inttoowa baz maaqqiko, ye hara kaatayir haakor yeezin dabbotodayis tiinattii cima dakkii oyicishshiza. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Yey garkke, yinttapp oonkka paas yeza baz ubbita ashshaam ixxiko ta tamaare maaqqodayis danda7ooya.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mali7oowa maxine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>«Maxine lo77o, zin maxine fa mal7a ashshiko, wayizii maxine giinttinttodayis danda7inee? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Biittaskka araddisoskka maaddoowa baz maaqqiz gishos alla olinttoda. Yikkee, si7iz hayer yez as si7o» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Dhabii bentteez dur Aaziso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat. 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Pettii gallas qaraxe gachishizitaynnee nagara oothiz asay Yesuusa timirtta si7odayis e lanqqayir shiiqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:29-30">Luq. 5:29-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Zin farasaawitayir higge asitamaaritay, «Yhay athay nagaranchchita shiishii ekkiza, unttar wolla miiza» yeegii zigireeza.<verse eid="LUK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Yesuusa yeegii yha aazisa unttis odeeza: <verse eid="LUK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>«Yi gancceppe pettayis xeet duritay yeza baz maaqqiko unttapp pettay dhabiko uddufun tamannee uddufunita wora ashshii dhabeezana denggod gatho koyoozay oonoo? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Denggeez wode ufayttii fa gannal tookkii, <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>fa kara maaqqiza. Fa laggittannee shoorita wolla xeegii, ‹Dhabeez ta duura denggeeza, taar wolla ufayttoytta› yeegiza. <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Yey garkkekka, maarotithi gelowa uddufun tamannee uddufun xillitaypp fa nagaras maaroteth geliz pettii athay gishos salo dammo ufayis maaqqiza.<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>«Woy taphphii shucha bira yeza pettii asita taphphipp pettat dhabiko denggod hellodayis xomppe aytihi keeth pittii miinthii koyoozay oonoo? <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Denggeez wode fa laggittannee fa shoorita xeegii ‹Dhabeez ta shuchcha birtto dengeez gishos taar ufayttoytta› yeegiza. <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Si7oytta, yey garkk pettii maarotith geliz nagaranchayir Xoossa kiitanchchitay tiina ufayssi maaqqiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dhabeez na7ay Aaziso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Maaqqii Yesuusa, «Pettii athayis nam77ii na7itay yeza. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Unttapp geedo na7ay fa adayiko, ‹Ta Adayyo, ne shalaypp ta bagga taas inggoba› yeegeeza. Aday fa shalana fa na7itayis shageeza. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Xiqqa gallasapp guye geedo na7ay fa bagga ubbita accii ekkii haakko gade yhanigeeza. Ezayid ekkii yhanigeez shalana toochchii wursseeza. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>E paas yeza baz ubbita wursseezaypp guye ye gadayid ubbayil miinth naye gelin metintteeza. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Yey gishos, ye gade asaypp pettay kara gata geleeza. Athay eza gudaylle heemmad garkk fa mootha dakkeeza. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Gudayllitay miiz harqqaypp maadayis amotteeza, zin izokka ezis inggiz asii benttekkaya. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Fa Wozinar, ‹Aappun ta aday ayllitayisi katha alla attin ta yhaydda nayer yhayqqe?› <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Denddii ta adayiko yhanigii, ‹Ta adayyo, salo Xoossa, sa7a nena ta qoheeza. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Yhanpp ne na7a ginttinttii xeeginttodayis taas beezoowa gishos ne kara yez ayllitaypp pettay garkk udii tana tayiboba› yeegoda» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Yey gishos, dendii fa adayiko yhanigeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">«Hano zin, E haga haakor yeezin aday qadhinttii, eziko woxxii yhanigii idinggii yeereeza. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Na7aykka, ‹Ta adayyo salo Xoossa, sa7a nena ta qoheeza. Yhanpp ne na7a ginttinttii xeeginttodayis taas beezoyya› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>«E aday ayllita xeegii, ‹Ellisii ubbapp lo77o maaqqeez afila ki7ii eza ma7issii; e biradhdhayidakka migiddo, e tokayid caamma aathoytta. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Modhdho mehe ki7ii shukkoytta, maada, ufayttoda. <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Ta na7ay yhayi yhayqqeeza, zin yhanno paxeeza; dhabeeza, zin bentteeza› yeegeeza. Yeyppe guye, ufayttithii aykkeeza.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>«Ye wode bayra na7ay woota gade yeza. Ezaypp yi7ittar kara ukkodar yethinnee donth giirthi si7eeza. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Ayllitaypp petta xeegii hanizay abizako erodayis oycceeza. <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Ayllay, ‹Ne ishay saro ye7eez gishos ne aday modhdho mehe ezis shukkeeza› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>«Bayra ishay kacinttii kara gelodayiskka koyekkaya. Aday bale kezii kara geloda garkk eza woosseeza. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Zin E fa adayiko, ‹Yeezako, yhay garkk laythi ta nees aylletti ne kiitappe pettokka pacinchekkazar nees kiittinttin ta ta laggitayir ufayttod garkk hara attozin pettii hooggo deesh taas inggekkaya. <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Zin, yhay ne na7ay ne shalana laammizitayir doonggii wurssii yi7in modhdho mehe shukkeene bay› » yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>«Adaykka, ‹Ta na7ayyo, ne ubba wode taar yeza, tabazi ubbay neesi. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Yhay ne ishay yhayqqeeza, zin paxeeza; dhabeeza, zin bentteeza. Yey gishos, gaame ufayttodayis beeziza› yeegoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Ammaninttowa shuumay aaziso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaritayiko, «Pettii dure athayis ezipp oommor pettii shuumay yeza. Ye shuumay fa goday shalana toochcheeza yeegii mooteeza. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Shalo goday shuuma xeegisii, ‹Taanii waagizin si7aree? Yhanpp ne ta keethis shuum maaqqii oothodayis danda7oowa gishos ta shalana tana helithoba› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>«Ye shuumaykka fa wozinar yhay garkke yeegii qoppeeza. ‹Ta goday tana shuumetithaypp wothod haniza, wootii aqodayis wolqqa baaya, woossii maadayis yeellathiza; yeezin ta wayizo? <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Shuumatithapp tana wodhisiko wode asay tana mokkod garkk oothod baz ta eriza› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>«Yey gishos, e goday aco yez asa petta petta xeegii ki7ii tiina athayko, ‹Neell afa ta goday aco aappunii yenee?› yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="LUK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>«E, ‹Xeet ota zayite aco yeza› yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:6">«Shuumay, ‹Wule warqatta yhayishee, ellisii, ishatam ota zayite aco yeza gi xaafoba› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>«Yeyppe kaali nam7inthayiko, ‹Nees aappunii yenee?› yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">«E, Xeet joniya ‹gistte aco yeza› yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">«Shuumay, ‹Ne wule warqatta yhayshe, ellisii, hosppun tam joniya yeegii xaafoba› yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Shalo goday ammaninttowa shuumay e bilaamatithayis nashshicheeza. Yha alamay na7itay as aythar poo7o na7itaypp aadheez wozinaamita.<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>«Yey gishos, ta yinttis odiza; yha worddo miishay worddor bentteez wodayid medhina keetha yinttan mokoday garkk miishayir yinttis laggita wonggoytta. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Ubbaypp xiqqa bazal ammanintteezay gaame bazal ammanintteeza maaqqiza. Ma ubbappi xiqqa bazal ammaninttowazay gaame bazal ammaninttooya. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Yikkee, yha alame miishel yi ammaninttaam ixxiko tuma miishe yinttis oonii hadara immade? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Yinttii hara as miishel ammaninttaam ixxiko, yi buzo miishe yinttis oonii immade?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>«Pettii ayllay nam77ii goditayis moodinttodayis danda7ooya. Petta ixxiko yhankkaya qadhdhiza woy pettayiko shiiqiko yhankkaya leqqiza. Yey garkk, yi Xoossisinnee miishes moodinttodayis danda7ooya.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mat. 6:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Miishe qadhdhiza Ferisaawitay yeya si7ii Yesuusa qaldeeza. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>E, «Yinttii yinttan as tiina xillisiza, zin Xoossay yi wozina eriza. As tiina bonchchintteezay Xooss tiina borintteeza.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>«Muse higgaynnee nabitay kiitay Waannisa hellodayis yinttis odinttittar gam7eeza. Yeyppe guye, Xoossa kaatetitha Wonggilay oothittar gam7eeza. Asii ubbay ye aqa gelodayis dafinttiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat. 11:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Maaqqozin, higgaypp pettii laafa pidaale attodaypp salorannee sa7ar aadhizay shawukkiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Mat. 5:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>«Fa machchat dakkii hara ekkiza ubbay wodire laammiza. Fa azinaypp anjjitteezano ekkeeziykka wodire laammiza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat. 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1 Qor. 7:10-11</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dure athannee Alaazara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>«Ali7onnee buquro afila ma77iza, sa7a hanin gallas gallas ufayisar yez pettii dure as yeza. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Hara ma gallay muumer madunxeez pettii Alaazara ginttinttiz manqqay ye dure athay bale doginttii atteezay yeza. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Nayepp dendeezayid dure athay leematepp wodhdhiz gufa maadayis amotitar yeza. Hara attozin, kanitay yi7ii e madotha laa7iza.<verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>«Ye manqqay yhayqqeeza; kiitanchchitay eza Afraame ki7o kanggeeza. Ma dure athaykka yhayqqii moogintteeza. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Si7oole un77inttii yezitar dhoqqi gi haakor Afraamennee e ki7o yez Alaazara be7eeza. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>E, ‹Adayyo Afraame, taasi qadhinttooye; yha lathi tamay gancce eexxittar yez gishos Alaazare fa biradhdhe xeerato haatha dakkii ta iranthato laakithod garkk hayyana eza dakkooye› yeegii uukkeeza.<verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>«Zin Afraame eziko, ‹Ta na7ayyo, ne sa7a yessayid lo77o baz ekkeezanannee, ma Alaazare iita baz ekkeezana akakoba. Zin yhatti E yhaydda ufayttiza, ma neenii waayttar yeza› yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Yha ubbapp aadhii, ‹Yhayppe yinttiko, yinippe yhana nuuko aadhodayis koyizitay piinggaam garkk nuusinnee yinttis gancce damma gaga yeza› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>«Dure athay, ‹Ta adayyo, yeezako Alaazara ta aday kara kiittod garkk ta nena woossiza. <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>Taas ichchin ishitay yeza, unttikka yha meto aqa ye7aamay garkk unttis yhanigii markkatto› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>«Zin Afraame, ‹Unttiss Muserannee nabitayir yeza; unttii odeez baz si7o› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>«Dure athay, ‹Adayyo Afraame, yey garkk baaya; pettii asii yhayiqopp denddii yhanigiko unttii maarotith geloda› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>«Afiraame, ‹Musennee nabita si7aam ixxiko, hara attozin yhayiqopp pettii asii denddii odikokka ammanenna› yeegeeza.»<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Asis dhube maaqqodaypp naagintto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaritayiko, «As dhubithii nagara gelssizabaz yi7ithay attenna. Maaqqozin, nagara gelod garkk oothiza athay ayye» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Ye athay xiqqitaypp petta balithodaypp woxa fa qoodhel accii abba gancce qitiko ezisi lo77o. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Yey gishos naaginttoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mat. 18:15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">«Ne ishay nagara oothiko kaccoba; qiiradhdhii maarotithar maaqqiko, ezis atto goba. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Pettii gallas laappun toke qohi, laappun toke, ‹Taanii ta buuta ereeza tana maaroba› yeegii yi7iko ezis atto goba.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Hawaaritay Godayiko, «Ammano nuus gujjooye» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Goday, «Sannaficce aafe garkk ammano yinttis yeziko ‹Yha wala shodinttii abba gancce tukinttoba› yeegiko yinttis kiitinttoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammaninttiza ayilay ooso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>Gujjikka Yesuusa, «Yi gancceppe pettayis wootiza woy dure heenggiz aylle yeziko ooso gadepp woy wudepp kara maaqqadar ‹Elle katha maadayis yhana yi7ii bettoba› yeegizay yenee? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Baaya, ‹Taas kaho giigisoba; ta mi, uzhii ashshod gatho eqqii muzoba. Yeypp guye, ne ma maadannee uzhoda› yeeginbaasa? <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Yikkee, goday, ayllay kiita poleez gishos anjjinee? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Yey gishos, yinttikka kiita ubbita poleez wode ‹Nu pathoowa ayllitay; oothodayis beeziza ooso poleeza› yeegoytta» yeeggeeza.<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Borqqontto harggepp geezheez taphphii asita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Yesuusa Yerusalaame yhanigittar Samaaresinnee Galila biittas ganccer qoo7ii aadheeza. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Pettii heera gelodar boriqontto harger aykintteez taphphii asitay ezana denggeeza. Unttikka haakko eqqii, <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>«Goda Yesuusa, nuus qadhinttooye» yeegii uukkeeza.<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>E unttan bi7ii «Yhanigii yi galla Ayihuditay qeese beezoytta» yeeggeeza. U oger yhanigttar geezheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lewii. 14:1-32</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Unttapp pettay fa geezhitha bi7ii dhoqqi geez qaalar Xoossa bonchchittar Yesuusako maaqqeeza. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Ezii Samaare biitta as, zin Yesuusa tokayil afa xuggunii eza galateeza.<verse eid="LUK 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Yesuusa, «Geezheezay taphphii asita baasa? Yeezin, uddufuntay aba yenee? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Yha allaga athaypp<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yha allaga athaypp: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Borqqontto hargaypp paxeez athay allaga giinttintteezay E Ayihuditay maaqqekka gishosi.</char></note> attin hara maaqqii Xoossa galatiza as benttekaya» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Athayiko, «Ne ammanay nena geeshsheeza; denddii qitoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooss kaattetith yi7ithi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat. 24:23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Ferisaawe asitay, «Xooss kaatetithay ayide ye7odee?» gi Yesuusana oycceeza. E, «Xooss kaatetithay naagor ye7ooya. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Maakka izo, ‹Yhannee woy yinne yeegodayis danda7ooya. Abis giiko, Xooss kaatetithay yi gancce yeza› » yeegii maheeza.<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaritayiko, «As Na7ay gallasitaypp petta be7adayis yi amottiz woday ye7oda, zin yi be7aamii. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Asay, ‹E yeyid yeza› woy, ‹Yhaydda yeza› yeegoda, zin unttan kaallii yhanigppatte. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Zeelinthii zeellinggii salo gaxapp gaxa poo7isizay garkk As Na7ay yi7ithi gallasay yey garkk hanoda. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Zin yeyi hanodaypp tiina As Na7ay gaame waayodayisinnee yha yeletithayid ixinttodayis beeziza. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Nohe wode haneezay garkk As Na7ay wodayidakka yey garkk hanoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Medhe. 6:5-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Nohe Markkabe geleez qamma hellodayis asay miitarannee uzhittar, ekkittarannee gelittar yeezin dhabisiza haathay yi7ii ubbita dhabiseeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Medhe. 7:6-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Looxe laythakka yey garkk haneeza. Asay miitarannee uzhittar, woonggittarannee bayizittar, tukkittarannee keexxittar, gam7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:28-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20-19:25">Medhe. 18:20—19:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Looxe Soodomappe kezeez gallas diinnee ginttinttiz xuuggiz tama salopp bukkii ubba baz dhabiseeza. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>As Na7ay benttiz wodekka yey garkk hanoda.<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>«Ye gallas oonkka bale yezay keethal yezaykka gancce yez baz ekkodayis kara gelippe. Yey garkke, gade yez asii abisikka kara maaqqippe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:17-18">Mat. 24:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:15-16">Mar. 13:15-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Looxe machchato akaakoytta;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Medhe. 19:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Fa shemppato ashshodayis koyiz asii oonkka dhabisoda; fa shemppato aathii inggiz oonkka ashshoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat. 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar. 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luq. 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Wan. 12:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Ta yinttis odiza; ye gallas nam77ii asay pettii arssal woyi7ada. Pettay ekinttoda, yhankkay attoda. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Nam77ii maachchitay wolla gaaccodar pettat ekinttoda, yhankkat attoda. <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>[Nam77ii asay wolla gade wootizitaypp pettay ekinttoda, yhankkay attoda»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pettii pettii maxaafitayid tayibo 36 baaya.</char></note> yeegeeza.]<verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Unttii, «Godayyo ana ekkinttodee?» yeegii oycceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">E, «Gawuxa yez bessa ankko shiiqiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Miinggii woossod garkk taamarsseeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Yesuusa fa taamarita azalekka ubba wode woossod garkk tamaarssodayis kozhii yeegii aaziso odeeza: <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>«Pettii katama Xoossis yashittowa asisikka yeellatoowa pettii dayinay yeza <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Ye katama gancce pettii am7at yeza. Izakka, ‹Taasinnee ta morkkay gancce yez moota pirddoba› yeegii ubba wode ye dayinnakka daaburssiza. <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Daynnay xiqqa wodes i oda si7aam ixxeeza, zin guyepp fa wozinar qopp, ‹Taanii Xoossis yashittaam, asis yeellataam ixxikokka, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>yha am7at tana ubba wode waayithiza gishos izis pirddoda; yeegii qoppeeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Godaykka, «Wuce dayinay geezana yi si7oytta; <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Xoossay qammannee gallas eziko uukkiza fa maraxxeezitayis pirddoosa? Unttan maaddodayis gam7inee? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Ta yinttis odizana si7oytta, ellisii pirddoda. Maaqqozin, As Na7ay yi7iz wode sa7all ammano demmadeshsha?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ferisaawanne qaraxe gachisiz atha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Ma mahii, Yesuusa, fana geeshsh as garkk uddii ceeqinttizitaysinnee yhankkita borizitayis yhay garkke yeegii aaziso odeeza: <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>«Nam7i asitay woossodayis Xooss kara yhanigeeza. Pettay Ferisaawe yhankkay ma qaraxe gachisiz as. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Ferisaaway eqqii paas woossittar, ‹Xoossayyo taanii yhankkitay garkk bonqqiza, zhucannee laammiza as, ubbarakka ma yha qaraxe gachisiz athay garkk baa gishos nena ta galatiza. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Saaminttapp nam7i toke xoomiza, ta denggizbaz ubbaypp asiraata kessiza› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>«Zini qaraxe gachisizay ma haakor eqqii hara attozin salo dhoqqi gi be7adayis yashittii fa tira qoxxitar ‹Xoossayyo, tana nagaranchchana maarooye› yeegii woosseeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat. 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luq. 14:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Ta yinttis odizana si7oytta; Farasaawayppe yhay qaraxe gachisizay Xooss tiina geesh maaqqii fa kara maaqqeeza. Abis giiko, fana dhoqqi dhoqqi udiza as kawuzhoda, fana kawushiza as dhoqqi dhoqqi goda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusarannee duude na7ita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-30">Mat. 19:13-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-31">Mar. 10:13-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Yesuusa duude na7itayil afa fa kusha gaddii anjjoday garkk asay eeko ki7iza. Yesuusa tamaaritay yeya bi7ii abis Yesuusako ki7inee yeegii kacceeza. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Zin Yesuusa na7ita faako xeegii, «Na7itay taako ye7odana kayppetee; ye7o goytta. Abis giiko, Xooss kaatetithay yhayititay garkk haneezitayis. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Ta yinttis turo odiza; Xooss kaatetitha duude na7ita garkk ekkozay oonkka ezayid gellamii» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dure athay oyichi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat. 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar. 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Ayihude halaqqitaypp pettay, «keeha asitamaarayyo, medhina de7o denggodays ab ootho?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Yesuusa eziko, «Abis tana keehayyo yeegii xeegee? Pettii Xoossapp attin hara keeha baaya. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Laammippe, wodhippe, kasitippe, worddo markattippe, ne adannee ne indat bonchchoba yeegiz kiita erinee» yeegii oyceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Kes. 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Nam7i. 5:16-20</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Athaykka, «Yeyitita ubba ta na7atithapp aykkii naagttar gam7eeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Yesuusa yeya si7ii «Yeezako, nees pettibaz pacciza; nees yez baz ubba bayizii manqqitayis inggoba; salo nena shalo naagiza. Yeezii maaqqii tana kaalloba» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Zin athay yeya si7ii ezis gaame shalo yeza gishos iita qiiratteeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Yesuusa atha bi7ii, «Dure asis Xooss kaatetithii gelo wayizii un77odeshsha! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Dure Xooss kaatetitha gelodayppe gimaale narppe lukor aadhizay shawukkiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Yeya si7eez asitay, «Yeya maaqqiko o attodee!» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Yesuusa, «Asis danda7inttoowa baz Xoossis danda7inttiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Phixiroosa, «Yeezako nu nubaz ubba ashshii nena kaalleeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>«Yesuusa tuma ta yinttis odiza; Xooss kaatetithayis gi fa kara woy fa machchato woy fa ishita woy fa adannee fa indat woy fa na7ita ashsheezay; <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>Yha wodayid gaame dakko, ye7od alamayid medhina de7o ekkozay oonkka baaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fa yhayiqo bagga mahii odeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat. 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar. 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Yesuusa taphpho nam7ita faako xeegii, «Ane Yerusalaame wolla yhammada, nabitay As Na7ay bagga xaafeezibaz ubbitay ezayid polinttoda. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>E Ayihude baa asayis aadhii ingginttoda. U eza toochchoda, cazhodannee ezal afa cuttoda. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Eza garafeezaypp guye wodhoda, Zin hayidzantho gallas E yhayiqopp dendoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Zini e tamaaritay yey ubbaypp pettibazkka akaakekkaya. E xuuray unttis qosintteez gishos E waageezakko erekkaya.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">To7a athay be7eeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat. 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mar. 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Yesuusa Iyarkko ukkodar pettii to7a athay oge gaxa bettii woossiza. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>To7a athay asitay ye aqayir aadhodar si7ii, «Yey abba?» gi oyceeza. <verse eid="LUK 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>U, «Naazirete Yesuusa yhayir aadhiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>E, «Dawute na7ayyo, Yesuusa, tana maarooye» yeegii uukkeeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Tiin tiin yhanigizitay, «Hayizoba» gi qoddeeza. Zin E, «Dawute na7ayyo, tana maarooye» yeegii darisii uukkeeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Yesuusa eqqii atha faako ko7od garkk kiiteeza. Athaykka, eeko shiiqin, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>«Ta nees ab udod garkk koyee?» yeegii oyceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">To7ay, «Godayyo ta be7adayis koyiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Yesuusa, «Bo7oba, ne ammanay nena patheeza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Athay izir bi7ii atteeza. Xoossa bonchchittar Yesuusa kaalleeza. As ubbay yeya bi7ii Xoossa galateeza.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Qaraxe gachchisiz Zakkoosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Yesuusa Iyarkko gelii aadhiza. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Ezayid Zakkoosa ginttinttiz qaraxe gachisizitay halaqay yeza. E gaame dure. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>E Yesuusa aayazako be7adayis koyeeza. E haata maaqqeez gishos asii darotithaypp dendeezayid Yesuusa be7adayis danda7ekkaya. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Yesuusa be7adayis kozhii E yhanigiza ogayis tiina woxxii yhanigii pettii gasare mithal afa kezeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Yesuusa ye aqa hellittar dhoqqi gi bi7ii, «Zakkoosa, yhayino ta ne kara peezhodayis beeziza gishos ellithii wodhdhoba» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>E ellis wodhdhii ufayisar Yesuusana mokkeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Ye aqayid yez as ubbay yeya bi7ii, «Nagaranchcho kara gelii mokinttodayis haniza» yeegii zigireeza. <verse eid="LUK 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Maaqqozin, Zakkiyoosa eqqii Godayiko, «Godayyo, yeezako taas yez shalo ubbaypp bagga manqqitayis immada. Asapp abikka worddor balithii ekkeezbaz maaqqiko oyddii kushe mahoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Yesuusa ma, «Yha athay Afraame na7a maaqqeez gishos yhayino atotithii yha kara ye7eeza. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>As Na7ay ye7eezay dhabeezana koyodayisinnee ashshodayis» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:10">Mat. 18:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Taphphii minaantay aaziso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat. 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Asay yeya si7ittar yezin Yesuusa Yerusalaame ukkeez gishos Xoossa kaatetithay yhatt ukkeeza aazeez gishos unttis aaziso odeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11-27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat. 25:14-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Yey gishos, Yesuusa, «Pettii damma asii yezay faasi kaatetithii mawute ekkii ye7odayis hara biitta yhanigeeza. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Ezis oothiz ayllitaypp taphphita xeegii taphphii minaanee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Minaanee: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minaanay Girike doona. Pettii minaanay pettii gallas ooso asis hayidzii agina damooze maaqqiza.</char></note> inggii ‹Ta maaqqii ye7od gatho yha miishayir zal7oytta› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>«Ye gade asay eza ixxiza gishos yha athay nuul afa kawutoda garkk nu koyooya yeegii as e guyer azazeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>«Maaqqozin, ye athay kaat maaqqii fa biitta maaqqeeza. Ye taphphii ayllitay E inggeez miishayir ab garkk zal7i wodhiseezako erodayis kozhii unttan xeegiseeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>«Tiinay yi7ii, ‹Godayyo, ne taasi inggeez miishayil hara taphpho wodhdhiseeza› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>«E Goday, ‹Neno ammaninttiza ayllayyo ne lo77o ootheeza. Neenii xiqqa bazal ammaninttiza gishos neesi taphphii katamitayil afa mawute inggeeza› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>«Nam7anthaykka yi7ii, ‹Godayyo, ne taasi inggeez miishay hara ichchin wodhdheeza› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>«Goday eziko, ‹Nessikka ma ichchin katamitayil afa mawute inggeeza› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>«Yeezako hadzanthay yi7ii, ‹Godayyo, ta qanxxor xaaxii naageez ne miishitta yhannasho. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Abis giiko, ne gaddekka baz ekkizanannee ne zerekkabaz maxiz iita as maaqqiz gishos neesi ta yashitteeza› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>«E goday mahii, ‹Neno iita ayllayyo ne doonatiigarkk ta nena pirddoda. Ta gaddekka baz ekkizanannee zerekkabaz maxiz iita as maaqqeeza ne eriko, <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>ta yi7ii ta miisha wodher ekkodgarkk zal7iza asis abis inggekkasa?›<verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>«E goday ye aqayid eqqeezayiko, ‹Ezar yez miisha ekkii taphpho wodhiseezayis inggoytta› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>«Unttii, ‹Godayyo, ezisi binnikka taphphii minaanay yeza› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>«Goday, ta yinttis odiza; ‹Yeza ubbayis hara guzhinttoda, zin baazaypp haray atto ezisi yezanakka ekinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat. 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mar. 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luq. 8:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Maaqqozin, ta unttal afa kawutamay garkk koyeezita ye ta morkkita yhana ta tiina ki7ii wodhoytta› geeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11-27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat. 25:14-30</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa damma bonchchor Yerusalaame geleeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat. 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Wan. 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Yesuusa yeya odeezaypp guye unttapp tiina aadhii yedhdhittar Yerusalaame yhanigeeza. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Debireezeytte Amibal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Debireezeytte guusay zayite keziz woyira mith kumeez aqo.</char></note> afa yez Beetefaagennee Bitaana ukkittar fa tamaaritaypp nam7ita yeegii azazeeza: <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>«Yi tiina yez heera yhanigoytta, yi ize hellodar oonkka toggibe7ekka accinttii yez hare na7a yi demmada. Eza billii yhana ekkii ye7oytta. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Oonkka, ‹Abis billee?› gi oyiciko, ‹Goday eza koyiza› yeegoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Kiitintteezitay yhanigii E geezay garkk hanin be7eeza. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Unttikka hare na7a billodar goditay bi7ii, «Hare na7a abis billee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Unttii mahii, «Godayis e koshshiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Ezaypp hare na7a Yesuusako ke7eeza. Fa afila hare na7ay zokkayil hixxii Yesuusana togiseeza. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Asaykka E yhanigiza ogayil afa fa afila hiixeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Debireezeytte Derell sulleth Yerusalaame wodhisiz ogeko ukkodar tayibor gaame asay unttii be7eez malatayis ufayttii fa qaala dhoqqi udii, Xoossa galata aykkeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>«Goday sunthar yi7iz kaatay anjjintteezaya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">salo saro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">ubbappi dhoqqe salo bonchcho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">Xoossayis maaqqo»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 19:38">yeegii Xoossa galateeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Maz. 118:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Asay gancceppe pettii pettii Ferisaawe asay Yesuusako, «Asitamaarayyo, ne taamarita hayizisoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>E unttiko, «Unttii si77e giiko shuchchitay uukkoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Yerusaalames yeekeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Yesuusa Yerusalaame ukkittar katama bi7ii izisi yeekkeeza. <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>«Nees sarayis maaqqadana yhayino ne erekkaya, yhattekka ne aafaypp qositteeza. <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Ne morkkitay ne kala gasi fa oger oger nena mari un77ithiza wode ye7oda. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Nenannee ne gase giddo yez ne na7ita dhabisoda. Pettii pettii shuchchi denthii laalloda, abis giiko Xoossay nena ashshodayis yi7iz woda ne erekkazay gishshosi» yeegii izis yeekkeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Yeyppe guye, Yesuusa Xoossa keethi gelii zal7izita ezaypp bayi7eeza. <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>Ma, «‹Ta keethay Xoossa woossiza keethi maaqqada› gi xaafintteeza, zin yi ta keetha paannitay komi7o udeeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa. 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Erim. 7:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Gallas gallas Xoossa Keetha taamarissiza. Qeese halaqitay, higge asitamaaritaynnee gade cimitay eza wodhodayis oge koyiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:37">Luq. 21:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Maaqqozin, asii ubbay e timirtta fa wozinas aathii si7iz gishos unttis oothod baz dhabeeza.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa mawutay Ayihuditayis oychchi maaqqeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat. 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar. 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Pettii gallas Yesuusa Xoossa Keethi gancce asa tamaarssodarannee Wonggile markkattodar, qeese halaqitay, higge asitamaaritaynnee gade cimitay wolla eziko yi7ii, <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>«Ne yhayitita aba mawuter oothizako nuus odoba. Yha mawuta neesi inigeezay oonoo?» yeegii oycceeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>E unttiko, «Taakka yinttan pettibaz oyccoda, ane taasi mahoytta. <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>Xammaqqiza Waannisa xinqqatay Xoossapenne asappee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>U woli gancce yeegii tobbeeza: «Xoossapp giiko yeezin, abis ammanekasa?» yeegoda.<verse eid="LUK 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>«Asapp giiko, asii ubbay Waannisa nabe maaqqizana ammaniza gishos nuna shuchchar shocoda.»<verse eid="LUK 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Yey gishos, «Anappezako nu erooya» yeegii maheeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Yikkee, taakka aba mawuter yhayitita oothizako yinttis odaamii» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Biitta wootii aqiz asay aaziso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat. 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar. 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa yeegii yha aazisa asayis odeeza: «Pettii asii woyine tukkeeza. Wootizitayis mattaye inggii gaame wode gam77ii ye7odayis hara gade yhanigeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:1">Isa. 5:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Woyne aafa maxiza woday hellin woyine aafaypp ezisi dakkod garkk biitta wootizitayiko fa aylla kiiteeza. Zin wootizitay ye aylla aykkii yhadhdhii kallo kushe dakkeeza. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Ma maaqqikka hara aylla kiiteeza. Ma biitta wootizitay eza yhadhdhii, toochchii kallo kushe dakkeeza. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Yhattekka mahii hayidzantho aylla kiiteeza. Wootizitay ezakka yhadhdhii madunthii woynnee ganccaypp gaxa kessii oleeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>«Woyine goday, ‹Yeezin ta ab ootho? An ma ta qadhdhiza ta na7a dakkoda; oonii eree u eza bonchchekka ashshaamii› yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>«Zin biitta wootizitay athay na7a bi7ii ‹Yhay eza laattodaya, yhana ye7oytta eza wolla wodhoda, yeeziko laatay nuus maaqqada› yeegii tobbeeza. <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Woyine ganccepp gaxa kessii wodheeza. Yeezin, woyine goday ye asita wayssadee? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Yi7ii ye biitta wootizunthan wodhoda, woyine gadana hara asayis immada. Asay yeya si7eez wode ‹Shinchchalle yey garkk baz hanippee» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Yesuusa unttan dakkii bi7ii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">«Yeezin ‹Gimbbe keexxiza asay boreez shuchchay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">keeth muumer tookkii aykkiz Kirkiro garkk ubbapp adhiz shuchchi maaqqeeza›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 20:17">ginttinttii xaafintteezayis birshshithay abba?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Maz. 118:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Ye shuchchyil afa wodhiz ubbay gaccinttoda, shuchchay ezal afa wodhdhiz ubbitaykka gaacinttoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Higge asitamaaritaynnee qeese halaqitay yha aazisay odintteezay unttal afa maaqqeezana erii ye wode eza aykkodayis koyeeza, zin woyayis yashitteeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Giira bagga shiiqeez oyich</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat. 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar. 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Yey gishos, Yesuusa gade aqisiza Oroome kaatayis aathii immadayis koyii e doonapp buuta qaala naagiza. Yeya polisodayis geeshsh as aazii qohiz asita eziko azazeeza. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Kiitinttii yhanigeez asay, «Asitamaarayyo, neenii odizayinee tamaarssizay likke maaqqeeza, ma Xooss oge tumatithar tamaarssizannee oonakka shaakkoozana nu eriza. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Hano zin, Oroome kaatayis giira giirodayis beezinennee beezoosa?» yeegii eza oycceeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Zin E u wozina iitatitha ereezi gishos <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>«Ane tana pettii santte beezoytta, Ezal afar yez misilaynnee sunthay o bazo?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">U mahii, «Qeesaareessii» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>E mahii, «yeezako, Qeesareesa Qeesaares, Xoossiisa Xoossis inggoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Yey gishos, E maheezi malssaypp woyay tiina buuta denggodays danda7ekkaya. U e mahiz malssa malabaz gi si77e geeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yhayiqopp denddo bagga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat. 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar. 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Yhayiqopp denddo baaya yeegiz Saduqaawitaypp pettay pettay Yesuusako yi7ii,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:8">Haw. O. 23:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>«Asitamaarayyo, pettii asii machcho ekkii na7a yelekkazar yhayqqiko, e ishay ye machchato ekkii na7ita yelii fa ishayis kochchii ashshoday garkk Muse xaafeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Nam7i. 25:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Yeezako laappun ishitay yeza. Bayiray machcho ekkii na7a yelekkazar yhayqqeeza. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>E kaalaykka izo ekkii na7a yelekkazar yhayqqeeza. <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>Hayidzanthaykka yey garkk haneeza. Laappunitay ubbay yhay garkk hanii izo ekkeeza, zin na7a yelekkazar yhayqqeeza. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Wurssithal asitakka yhayqqeeza. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Yikkee, laappun ishitay izo ekkeez gishos yhayqqopp denddiza wode iza o machcho maaqqadee?» yeegii oycceeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Asay yha alamayill ekkizannee geliza. <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>Zin yhayiqopp denddii ye7od alamayill yezodayis beeziza asay ekkooyannee gelooya. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Unttii kiitanchcho garkk maaqqiz gishos tiinapp yhayqqenna. Yhayiqopp dendeez gishos unttii Xooss na7ita. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Muse Goda, ‹Afraame Goda, Isaaqa Goda, Yayqqooba Goda› maaqqii tusha wora gancce xuuggiz tama taarika xaafeezayid yhayqqeez asay denddizana beeziza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kes. 3:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Ubbay ezis path yeza maaqqiz gishos E pathi yezitay Godaypp attin yhayqqeezitay Goda baaya» yeegii maheeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Higge asitamaaritaypp pettay pettay, «Asitamaarayyo, lo77o baz ne odeeza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Yeyppe guye, hara oych oyccodayis yashitteeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosa o na7a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat. 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar. 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Ezaypp maaqqii Yesuusa unttiko, «Asay Kiristtoosa wayizii Dawute na7a yeegee? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42-43"/>Abis giiko, Dawute fa ubbas fa mazmuure maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42-43">«Xoossay ta Godayiko ‹Ta ne morkkita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42-43">ne tokay yedhdheez besse oothod gatho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42-43">taapp ushachch baggar bettoba› geeza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 20:42-43">yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:42-43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:42-43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>«Yikkee, Dawute Kiristtoosa, ‹Goda gi xeegittar ezis na7a wayizii maaqqee?› » yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Woya ubbitay si7odar fa tamaaritayiko, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>«Aduss afila ma77ii yuushshe dosizitaypp, gabe gancce bonchcho sarotho, Ayihuditay Woosa Keetha bonchcho oyde, mokinttiza karakka bonchcho aqo koyiz higge asitamaaritaypp naaginttoyta. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Unttikka am7itay kara kallosiza, geesh as aazii as beezodayis woosa adussiza. U iita pirdde ekkoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Am7ati muxaata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mar. 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Dure asay Xooss Keetha muxaata saaxine olodar Yesuusa dhoqqi gi asa be7eeza. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Ma pettii manqqo am7at nam77ii sikkina olodar bi7ii, <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>«Ta yinttis turo odiza; yha manqqo am7at ubbapp aathii inggeeza. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Abis giiko, yha asii ubbitay fassi yeza bazapp inggeeza, Zin iza fa paccattipp, paas yez aqo peesh ubba inggeeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurissith layth mallita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat. 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-23">Mar. 13:3-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Yesuusa tamaaritaypp pettay pettay Xooss Keethay gaame lo77iza shuchcharannee asay Xoossis inggeez imotar lo77eezana odinttiza. <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>Zin Yesuusa, «Yha yi bi7iza bazay ubbitay laalinttekkazar, shuchchi shuchchal afa gimbbintteezay garkk attam wode ye7oda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Unttikka, «Asitamaarayyo, yha ubbitay hanoday ayide? Ma yhay hanodayis mallay abba?» yeegii oycceeza.<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Yesuusa yeegii unttiss malsse inggeeza: «Balinttamay garkk naaginitoytta. Gaamitay, ‹Taanii Kiristtoosa, woday ukkeeza› yeegittar ta sunthayir ye7oda, zin yi unttan kaallippate. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Yi ola baggannee cabbo si7eez wode dagammippate. Yey tiinattii hanoday attowa baz maaqqiz gishos wode wurssithay ellis ye7ooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Maakka, «Woyay woyal afa, kaatetithay kaattetithal afa dendoda. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Gita biitta eni7o hanoda, nayennee gado duma duma bessa daroda, yashshizibazinnee gaame malatitay salopp benttoda. <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Zin yha ubbay hanodaypp tiina ta sunthay gishos gi asay yinttan bayi7odannee aykkoda. Ayihuditay Woosa Keethi ganccennee achch keetha yinttan dakkoda. Kaatitay tiinannee gade aqisizitay tiina yinttan kammada. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Yeykka ta bagga yi unttiss markattodayis lo77o oge maaqqada. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Yey gishos, yi oyccinttiz wode waagii malsse immade gi yi wozinar un77inttaam garkk akaakoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Luq. 12:11-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Abis giiko, yi morkkitay yinttar eqinttodayssinnee palamodayis danda7oowa doonannee eccetithii ta yinttis immada. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Hara attozin, yinttan yeleezitay, yi ishitay, yi dabbitayinnee laggitay yinttan aathii immada. Yi ganccepp petta petta wodhoda. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Ta sunthay gishos asii ubbitay tiina yi ixintteezita maaqqada. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Zin hara attozin, yi cimibayppe pettii binnanakka dhabenna. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Yi, Danda7ar, yi shemppo ashshoda.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaame dhabo bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>«Yerusalaame katamay wotaaddaritayir marinttii betteezin yi bi7iko izis dhabo ukkeezana eroytta. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Ye wode Yihuda giddo yez ubbitay amiba guye qosintto, katama yezitay yeypp kezo, gaxare yezitay katama gelippe. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Abis giiko, yha xaafintteezibaz polinttod garkk yeyi Xoossay kushe mahiz wode.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:7">Hosa. 9:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Sa7all afa damma meto ye7oda, ye sa7ayidakka asal afa Xooss kachchii ye7oda. Yey gishos, wodexxezitannee dhanthizita ayye. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>U mashshar yhayqqada, asii ubbitay allaga biitta di7inttoda. Ayihude maaqqekka asita woday polinttod gatho Yerusalaame unttar yedhintteeza maaqqada.<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">As Na7ay yi7ith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>«Awa, aginarannee, xoolinttitayil afa malatitay hanii benttoda. Abbappennee zulo shochaypp dendeezayid biittal yez asay yashittii un77inttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa. 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Iziqe. 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:31">Erim. 2:31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Wan. Qon. 6:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Salo wolqqitaykka buqinttoday gishos asay yashsharannee biittal afa abi haneneshsha gi naagor fana dogoda. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Ye wode As Na7ay wolqqarannee gaame bonchcho shaarar ye7odar u be7ad.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Daan. 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Wan. Qon. 1:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Yi atotithay ukkeez gishos yha hanitay polintto aykkiz wode giiginttii eqqoytta, dhoqqi gi bo7oytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Ma maaqqikka, yhay garkk gi aaziso odeeza: «Balase mithinnee hara mithii ubba bo7oytta. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>U hayay furicodar bone ukkeeza yi eriza. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Yey garkk yha hanitay polnttodar yi bi7iko Xooss kaatetithay ukkeezana eroytta.<verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>«Ta yinttis turo odiza; yha ubbay polinttod gatho yha yeletithitay aadhaamii. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Salonnee sa7a aadhoda, zin ta qaalay aadhaamii.<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>«Yikkee, yi ushshii darorannee, mather yessis un77inttii yi wozinay aykkinttam garkkennee ye qammay akaakekkazin xike garkk yinttal afa hellaamay garkk naaginttoytta. <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Ye qammay biittal yez ubbayil afa hellii xikisii aykkoda. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Yey gishos, yi7iza iitaypp attodayissinnee As Na7ay tiina eqqodayis danda7od garkk ubba wode miinggii woossoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Gallas gallas Yesuusa Xooss Keetha tamaarssittar, qamma qamma Debireezeytte Amibal afa kezii aqiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luq. 19:47</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Asay ubbitay eza si7odayis wontt guura eziko Xoossa keetha yi7iza.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Yihuda Yesuusana aathii immadayis maaqqintteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat. 26:1-5</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:14">14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar. 14:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">10-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Wan. 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Ye wode Faaziqa yeegiz boora Baale ukkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1">Kes. 12:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Qeese halaqitaynnee higge asitamaaritay asayis yashitteez gishos wayizii Yesuusa fa ganccepp dhabisodazako oge koyiza. <verse eid="LUK 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Xalahe taphpho nam7itaypp petta maaqqeez Asiqorontto Yihuda ginttinttizay gancce geleeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Yihuda qeese halaqitayikkora Xoossa Kara naagizitayis halaqitayiko yhanigii Yesuusa wayizii aathii inggodazako unttar maaqqeeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Unttikka yeyid ufayttii miishe ingodayis ezar tobbeeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Ezikka ye zorayid giigeeza. Unttis asii erekkazin Aathii immadayis giiga wode naagttar yeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurissith kaho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat. 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar. 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Wan. 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Yeyppe guye, Faaziqa duray shukinttiza boora Baale helleeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Yesuusa, «Faaziqa kaho maaday garkk yhanigii nuus giigisoytta» yeegii Phixiroosannee Waannisa kiiteeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>U, «Nu aba giigisod garkk ne koyee» yeegii oycceeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>E unttiko, «Yeezako yi katama gelodar haath ota tookkeez athay yinttan helloda. E yhanigii geliza kara eza kaali geloytta. <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>Ye kara adayiko asitamaaray, ‹Ta ta tamaaritayira wolla Faaziqa kaho maadayis imathi shemppiza kara aba yenee? yeegeeza› goytta. <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>E pooqeel afa hiixinttii giigii yez dalgge kifile yinttan beezoda, ezayid makkoytta» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>U yhanigii Yesuusa geezay garkk hanin denggeeza. Faaziqa baale kaho ezayid giigiseeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Saataykka helleez wode Yesuusa hawaaritayir wolla kahol afa betteeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>E unttiko, «Ta waaye ekkodaypp tiina yha kaha yinttar maadayis lo7ithii amotteeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Yikkee, si7oytta! Xooss kaatetith yhayis birshshithay polinttod gatho yhayinopp guye yha kaha mahii maamii» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Ushsha ekkii galatii maaqqii, «Yashitte yhaya yi gancce shaginttoytta. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Si7oytta! Xooss kaatetithay ye7od gatho yhayinopp aykkii yha woyine ushshaypp maaqqii ta uzhaamii» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Boora denthii ekkii, galatii maaqqii, «Yhay yinttis ingginttiza ta asho. Yhaya oothittar tana qoppoytta» yeegii unttis baxxii inggeeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Yey garkkekka, kahopp guye ushsha ekkii, «Yha ushshay yinttis laalintteez ta suuth maaqqiz oroth caaqo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31">Erim. 31:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>Maaqqozin, tana aathii inggod athay kushay taar wolla pili7o gancce yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Maz. 41:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>As Na7ay ezis giinttintteezay garkk yhayqqodayis yeza, zin eza aathii inggiz athaya ayye» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>U fa gancce, «Yhaya oonii oothodee» gi woli oyccichcheeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubbaypp aadho maaqqaday oonoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Ma u gancce aadho maaqqaday oonoo giz palama medhintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:1">Mat. 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:34">Mar. 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46">Luq. 9:46</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Gade kaatitay fa asita wolqqar mooddiza; fa gadel afa godatizttayikka fana, ‹Lo77o oothizita› yeeginttiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:25-27">Mat. 20:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-44">Mar. 10:42-44</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Zin yi gancce yey garkk maaqqippe. Yi gancce bayratizay kaalo garkk hano;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat. 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar. 9:35</ref></char></note> kaalithizay kaallizay garkk hano. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Hano zin, mokkizayppennee Mokinttizaypp aayi aadhee? Mokinttiza baasa? Zin taanii yi gancce mokkizay garkk.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:12">Wan. Qon. 13:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>Yinttikka ta metayir taapp shaakinttoowa taar miinggii eqqeezita. <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29-30"/>Yi ta leematepp maad garkk, uzhod garkkennee zufaanitayil afa bettii taphpho nam77ii Isreele sheeshitayil afa pirddod garkk ta aday tana shuumeezay garkk taakka yinttan ta kaatetitithayil shuumoda» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:29-30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mat. 19:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:29-30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pixiroosa kaddeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>Maaqqikka Yesuusa, «Simoona, Simoona, Xalahe yinttan gistte garkke harqqodayis woosseeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Zin taanii ne ammanay dhabaam garkk nees wooseeza. Neekka maaqqeez wode ne ishita minthathob» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Simoona, «Godayyo, taanii neer accinttodayisnnee yhayqqodayis giigintteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Yesuusa Phixiroosako, «Ta nees odiza; yhayino shugula uukkodaypp tiina ne tana hayidzii toke kaddoda» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Ma maaqqikka, Yesuusa unttiko, «Taanii yinttan korojjo, qurbonnee caamma baazin kiiteez wode yinttis pacceez baz yenee?» yeegii oycceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:9-10">Mat. 10:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-9">Mar. 6:8-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3">Luq. 9:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">U mahii, «Akkokka paccekkaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>E unttiko, «Yhatti korojjonnee qurbo yezay aykko; mashsha baazay fa afila bayizii mashsha wonggo. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Yhana si7oytta! ‹Zhucitayir taybintteeza› ginttinttii xaafintteezay taal polinttodayis beeziza. Ee, ta gishos xaafintteezibaz polinttizay tumateeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa. 53:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>E tamaarttay, «Godayyo yhaydda nam77ii mashsha yeza» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">E, «Gidoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Debireezeytte amibal afa woosseeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat. 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar. 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Yesuusa kaseesay garkk denddii Debireezeytte Amibal afa kezeeza. E tamaarttay eza kaalleeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Ye aqa helleez wode yi «Paace gancce gelaamay garkk woossoytta» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Unttapp shuchchi dhogin helliza aqo garkk haakkii bunqqittii woosseeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>«Ta Adayyo, ne shene maaqqiko yha meto xuu7a taapp aathoba. Zin ta shene maaqqippe ne shenay hano» yeegii woosseeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Minthathiza. Kiitanchchay salopp bentteeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Gaame un77inttii miinthii woossiza. E cawaykka suuthii xokkizay garkk sa7a xokkeeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Yesuusa woosa wurssii fa tamaaritayiko ye7eeza. U, azzanoppe dendeezayid daaburii gentteezin denggii, <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>«Abis genttee? Paace gancce gelaam garkk denddii woossoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa aykintteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat. 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Wan. 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>E haga odal afa yezin gaame asay ye7eeza. Taphpho nam7itaypp pettay Yihuda ginttinttizay unttan kaalithiza. E Yesuusa yeerodayis lanqqe Shiiqeeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Zin Yesuusa, «Yihuda, As Na7a yeerii aathii immade?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Yesuusa tamaaritay ye hana bi7ii, «Godayyo nu mashshar gachcho?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>U ganccepp pettay qeese halaqay ayillayis shocii ushachch haytto gachchii oleeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Zin Yesuusa, «Ashshoba!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:51 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ashshoba! Koyppate: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesuusa yha bessayid ashshoba yeegeezay eza ashshodayis gi athay haya gachcheezana ashshoba gachchippe geezanne, hara asay eza aykkodayis ye7eezita kayppate yhatt u wode yegeezita nam7i qofita woli helthii aykkeeza.</char></note> yeegeeza. Athay haya bochchii patheeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa fana aykkodayis ye7eez qeese halaqitayiko, Xooss Keeth naagizita shuumitaykonnee cimitaykko, «Paanno aykkiz as garkk mashshannee gufe aykkii ye7eenee? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Ubba gallas Xooss Keethi gancce ta yinttar yez wode taal afa kushe gaddekkaya. Zin yhay dhuma kaatetithay mooddeez wodennee yi wode» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luq. 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phixiroosa Yesuusana kaddeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat. 26:57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:67-75">67-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mar. 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Wan. 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Yeyppe guye, Yesuusa aykkii qeese halaqay zabba kanggeeza. Phixiroosa haakor Yesuusa kaalliza. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Asay qeese halaqay zabbayid tama eethii wolla betteezin Phixiroosa unttar wolla betteeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Pettii gadhindata Phixiroosa tama lanqqe betteezana tama foo7ayir dakkii bi7ii, «Yha athay ezar yeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Zin Phixiroosa, «Yhan asitee ta ye atha erooya» yeegii kaddeeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Xiqqa saattepp guye pettii hara athay eza bi7ii, «Neekka unttapp pettabay» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Zin Phixiroosa, «Yha athayyo tana baaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Pettii saate garkk gam7eezaypp guye pettii hara athay tillisii, «Yha athay Galilapp maaqqiz gishos sidhe bayith ezar yeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Zin Phixiroosa, «Yha athayyo, ne gizana ta erooya» yeegeeza. E ye oda wurssekkazin shugula uukkeeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Goday guye shirnttii eqqii Phixiroosa be7eeza. Phixiroosa, «Yhayino shugula uukkodaypp tiina ne tana hayidzii toke kaddoda» yeegii, Goday odeez qaalay ezis elqqi geeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Phixiroosas bale kezii dukka suuth yeekkeeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Philaaxoosa tiinannee Herodossa tiina shiiqeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat. 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar. 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Wan. 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Yesuusa naagiz asay eza laqqasonnee yhadho aykkeeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>E aafa goozii «An ne Nabezako eroba; nena shoceezay oonoo?» yeegii oyiciza. <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Hara gaame cashshii cazhii kawushiseeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Sa7a wonttiza wode Ayihude gade cimitay, qeese halaqitaynnee higge asitamaaritay shiiqii, Yesuusana fa tiina shiisheeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>U, «Ne Kiristtoosa? Ane nuus odoba?» yeegii oyiceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Yesuusa, «Ta odizakon yi ammanaamii. <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>Ta oycizako yi mahaamii. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Zini As Na7ay yhaypp gede wolqqama Xooss ushachch baggar bettoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Ye wode ubbitay, «Yeezin, ne Xoossa na7a?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Ee, «Ta Xooss na7a maaqqeezana yi geeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>U, «Yikkee, hara markka ab koshshee? E fa doonar ododar nu si7eeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Philaaxoosa tiinayid</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar. 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Wan. 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Ye aqayid shiiqeez ubbitay dendii Yesuusana Philaaxoosako kanggeeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>«Yha athay nu asita balethitar, Oroome kaatayis giira giiraamay garkk kayttarannee ma, ‹Taanii Kiristtoosa yi kaata› yeegodar nu denggeeza» yeegii mooteeza.<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Philaaxoosa Yesuusana, «Neenii Ayihuditay kaatonnee?» yeegii oyceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesuusa, «Ee, ne geezay garkke» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Philaaxoosa qeese halaqitayikonnee asayiko, «Yha athayil afa ta pettii buutakka denggekkaya» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Zini unttii, «Yha athay Galilappe yhaya hellodayis Yihuda muumer iita bazis denthithiza» yeegii miinthii odeeza.<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Philaaxoosa yeya si7eez wode Yesuusa Galila aso yeegii oyceeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Yesuusa Herodoosa gadepp ye7eez as maaqqeezana Philaaxoosa ereezaypp guye Herodoosa ye wode Yerusalaame yez gishos eziko dakkeeza.<verse eid="LUK 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Herodoosa tiina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Herodoosa Yesuusa be7adayis gaame wodeppe koyttar yez gisho eza be7eez wode gaame ufayttee. Abis giiko, ebaz si7eez gisho malabaz udin be7adayis amotitar yeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Herodoosa Yesuusana gaame oychchi oyceeza, Zin E abikka mahekkaya. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Qeesitay halaqitayinnee higge asitamaaritay ezayid eqqii miinthii eez mootiza. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Heroodosarannee e wotaaddaritayir Yesuusa laqqaser leqqeeza. Buquro afila ma7isii Philaaxoosako mahii dakkeeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Heroodosarannee Philaaxoosar tiin morkkezin ye gallas wolla igintteeza.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pilaxoosa Yesuusal pirddeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Philaaxoosa qeese halaqita, gade aqisizitannee woyita xeegii, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>« ‹Yha athay iita bazis denthithiza› gi taako yi ke7eeza. Taakka yi tiina pilagii bi7ini yi shiisheez mootayis aba buutakka eel denggekkaya. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Herodoosa, yey garkk aba buutakka ezal afa denggekka gishos nuuko dakkeeza. Tuma yha athay yhayiqos helithiz aba buutakka oothekkaya. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Yey gishos, eza garafii billii dakkoda» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>[Yeya E geezay Faaziqa Baale wode pettii as achchapp unttiss billizay ezis attowa baz maaqqeez gishosi.]<verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Woya ubbitay pettipp, «Yha atha gede hali7isoba, nuus Baribaana billoba» yeegii uukkeeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Baribaana katama gancce as iita bazis denthithii as wodhdhii accintteez asii.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Philaaxoosa Yesuusana bili7odayis koyii asayis mahii odeeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Maaqqozin, asay, «sottoba! sottoba!» yeegii uukkeeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Philaaxoosa hayidzintho, «Yha athay qoheez bazay abba? Wodhos helithiz buuta ta denggekkaya. Yey gishos, garafii dakkoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>U fa qaala dhoqqi udii, «Sotinttodayis beeziza» gi miinthii uukkeeza. U uufaykka usa dareeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>U oyichay gishos gi Philaaxoosa ezal afa pirddeeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Asa iita bazis denthithizannee as wodhdhii accintteezana billod garkk woosseez, ye atha unttiss bili7eeza. Zin Yesuusa unttii koyeez baz oothod garkk unttiss aathii inggeeza.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa sottintteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:31-44">Mat. 27:31-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Wan. 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Yesuusana aykkii kammadar Simoona giz Qerena biitta athay gaxarepp ye7odar, denggii maziqala toossii Yesuusa kaallii yhammad garkk ciiphicheeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Gaame assaynnee u ganccepp fa tira qoxxitar yeekkiza maachchitay e guyayir kaalliza.<verse eid="LUK 23:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Zin Yesuusa unttiko guye maaqqii Yesuusa, «Yinttanno, Yerusalaame maachitayyo, yi ubbayisinnee yi na7itayis yeekkoyttapp attin taasi yeekkippate. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>‹Yezako dhonthitay, yelekka ulitaynnee ammisekka ammitay anjjintteeza› yi yeegoda gallasay ye7oda. <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Ye wode ambitakka, ‹Nuul afa woddoytta›, deritakka, ‹Nuna qosoytte› yeegoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hosa. 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Wan. Qon. 6:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Yikkee, irxxa minxxa yey garkk oothiko mela minxxa wayissadeshsha?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Ezar wolla wodhodayis hara nam77ii paanita kanggeeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Qeeraniyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:33 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Qeeraniyo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Qeeraniyo gizay Girike doona. Aramayke doonar «Golggotta» woy «Omma guutte» guussii. Qeeraniyo giz sunthay ingintteezay Yesuusa sotintteezay as omma guutte aaziz bessayid maaqqiz gishosi. Ye aqay Oroome kaatetithay paanita soxxodar aqo. (Maato 27: 33; Mar. 15:22; Waan 19:17)</char></note> ginttinttiz aqo helthii sotteeza. Paanitaypp petta ushachch baggar yhankka haddiris baggar sotteeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Yesuusa, «Ta adayyo, u ab oothizako eroowa gishos neenii unttis atto goba» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Maz. 22:18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">U e afilayil afa ixa olii shaakinttii ekkeeza.<verse eid="LUK 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Asay eqqii be7adar, gade moodizitay, «E Hara asa ashsheeza; Xoossay maraxeez Kiristtoosa eza maaqqiko an fana ashsho» yeegii leqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Maz. 22:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:7">Maz. 22:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Wotaaddaritay eziko shiiqii, caala woyne ushsh inggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Maz. 69:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>Yeezii, «Neenii Ayihuditay kaat maaqqiko ane ne ubba ashshoba» yeegii leqqeeza.<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Ezis omma baggar, «Yhay Ayihuditay kaat» yeegiz xuufe Girikithora, Oromithora, Ibirayisxxithora xaafii gaddeeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Sottintteez paanno pettay cashshe sa7ar goochchitar, «An neenii Kiristtoosa maaqqiko, nenakka nunakka ashshoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Zin yhankko paannay, «Ne yhay garkk pirddar yezar hara attozin, Xoossis yashittaamoo? <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Nuunii nu buutayis beeziza pirdde ekkiza, Zin yha athay pettii iitabazkka oothekkaya» yeegii kacintteeza.<verse eid="LUK 23:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Maakka, «Yesuusa, ne ne kaatetithar yi7iz wode tana qoppoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Yesuusa, «Ta nees turo odiza; yhayino ne taar gannatte yessada» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa yhayiqo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat. 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar. 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Wan. 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44-45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44-45"/>Ye gallas usuppun saatepp yhanigii uddufun saate gatho awa poo7o kayeez gishos biitta ubbayil afa dhuma maaqqeeza. Xooss Keeth magarazhay per7inttii nam77ii aqo shaakintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:44-45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31">Kes. 26:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:44-45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Yesuusa, qaala dhoqqi udii, «Ta Adayyo, ta ta shemppato ne kushayid inggeeza» yeegii yhayqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Maz. 31:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Mato halaqay, haneezaya bi7ii, «Yha athay tumakka geeshsh» yeegii Xooss galateeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Yha hanizabaza be7adayis ye aqayid shiiqeez as ubbay haneezibaza bi7ii fa tira qoxxitar fa kara maaqqeeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Maaqqozin, Yesuusa lanqqe eriza as ubbay, yey garkkekka Galilappe kaalli ye7eez maachchitay yeya bi7ittar haakor eqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2">Luq. 8:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa moogintto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar. 15:42-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51"/>Ayihude shanggitaypp pettay, Yooseefa ginttinttiz athay yeza. E Armmatiyasa ginttinttiz Yihuda katamapp ye7eeza. E lo77onnee Geesh as maaqqiz gishos Xoossa kaattetithay yi7ithana naagiza. Shanggitaypp petta maaqqittar u zoretitharannee oosayir baaya. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Ye athay Philaaxoosako yhanigii, Yesuusa aha moogodayis taas inggoba gi woosseeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Yesuusa aha wodhisii afilar xaaxeeza. Zaalla woocii kesseez hara as mooginttekka orothi duufo gancce gaddeeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Maala gelod haniza gishos ye gallasay giigintto qamma.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Galilappe denddii Yesuusa kaalli ye7eez maachchitay Yooseefar wolla yhanigii e aha wayizii moogizakko duufa akaakii be7eeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Ezaypp maaqqii shittonnee qibaate giigiseeza. Higge kiittizay garkk maala gallas shempp peezheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Kes. 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:14">Nam7i. 5:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa yhayiqopp denddeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat. 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar. 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Wan. 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Saaminttapp Tiina gallas, wogga wode guura yeciyeco, maachchitay fa giigiseez shitto ekkii duufayiko yhanigeeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>U ize hellodar duufay doona yez shuchchay gol77al7ii hali7eezana denggeeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>U duufa helii geleeza, zin Goda Yesuusa aha denggeekaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>U ezayid eqqii abii haneenee gi qoppodar akaakekkazin booth pociz afila ma7eez nam77ii asitay u kale eqqeeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Maachchitay yashittii fa omma sa7a ziqqi udii yezin, asitay unttiko, «Pathana yhayiqitay gancce abis koyee? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6-7"/>E yhaydda baaya; yhayiqopp denddeeza, ‹asii Na7ay nagara oothizttay kushe aadhii inginttoda; unttikka eza sottoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mat. 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:18-19">20:18-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mar. 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33-34">10:33-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luq. 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18:31-33</ref></char></note> E hayidzantho gallas yhayiqopp dendoda› yeegii, E yinttar Galila biitta yezitar yinttis odeez qaala qoppoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 24:6-7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Maachchitay ye wode e qaala qoppeeza.<verse eid="LUK 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Maachchitay duufayipp maaqqii haneezibaza ubbita taphpho pettitayisinnee yhankkitayisikka odeeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Yeya hawaaritayis odeezay Magdeela Mayramo, Yohaanna, Yayqqooba indat Mayiramirannee unttar yez hara maachitta. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Zin unttiss maachchitay odeezay elmmo aazin ammanekkaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Zin Phixiroosa denddii woxxii duufo yhanigeeza. Ye aqa hellii zuggii be7adar moogo afila aadda be7eeza. Haneez bazayiss malabazigittar fa kara maaqqeeza.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Emmahuuse ogel afa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mar. 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Ye gallas kaalliza tamaaritaypp nam7itay Yerusalamepp taphpho nam77ii kilo mitire haakkiza Emahuuse heera yhanigiza. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>U wolla haneezibaza ubbita odinttiza. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>U ye hanay bagga qoppittarannee odinttittar yhanigodar Yesuusa fa ubbas shiiqii unttar yhanigiza. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Hano zin, unttii eza eraamigarkk u aafay aykintteeza.<verse eid="LUK 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>E, «Yi wolla ogel afa odinttizay abba?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">U azzanii si77e gi eqqeeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Unttapp pettay Qeliyoopha ginttinttizay, «Yha qammitay gancce Yerusalaame haneezibaza eroozay, ne biittas imathonee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>E mahii, «E haneezay abba?» yeegii oycceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Unttii, «Xooss tiinannee as tiina oosorannee odar miinthii nabe maaqqeez Naazirete Yesuusa bagga. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Eza qeese halaqitaynnee nuna aqisizitay yhayiqo pirddes aathii inggii, sotteeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Nuunii Isreele asa wozode gi ufayttii naageezin yhay hanin yhayino hayidzantho qamma. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Ma nu ganccepp pettii pettii maachchitay nuna doona ayitheeza. Unttii yhayino wontta guura duufo yhanigeeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>E ahay dhabin maaqqii yi7ii, ‹E pathi yeza› yeegizana kiitanchchitay qonccisin be7eeza yeegii odeeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Nu gancceppekka pettay pettay duufa yhanigii maachchitay odeezay hanin be7eeza, Zin eza u be7ekkaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>E unttiko, «Yinttano, akaakowa asitayyo, yi wozinay nabitay odeez baz ubbita ammanodayis gam7izitayyo, <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Kiristtoosa yha meta ekkodayissinne fa bonchchayir gelodayis beezoosa?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Museppennee nabitay ubbaypp dendii Geeshsha Maxaafayid ebazi xaafintteezana ubba unttiss paatteeza.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Unttii yhanigiza gutayiko ukkodar Yesuusa aadhii haakko aqo yhanigiza aazin, <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Unttii, «Sa7ay qammeez gishos nuur aqoba» yeegii miinthii woosseeza. Yey gishos, unttar aqodayis geleeza.<verse eid="LUK 24:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Unttar wolla munttal afa bettii, boora, denthii anjjii unttiss baxxii inggeeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Ye wode unttii eroday garkk u aafay dooyintteeza. Unttikka ereeza. Zin E u kalayipp dhabeeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Unttii, «Nu ogel afa yeezin E nuus Geeshsha Maxaafa billittarannee nuur nashshodar nu wozinay xuuginttekasa?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Ye wode dendii guye Yerusalaame ye7eeza. Taphpho pettitayira yhankkitay pettipp shiiqii yeezin denggeeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>Unttii, «Goday tuma denddeeza; Simoonas bentteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 24:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Ye nam77ii tamaarttay Emmahuuse ogel afa yezin haneezanannee boora meez wode wayizii eza ereezako unttiss odeeza.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fa tamaaritayis bentteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat. 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Wan. 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Haw. O. 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Nam77ii tamaaritay ye odayil afa yezin, Yesuusa u gancce eqqii, «Saro yinttis maaqqo» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Maaqqozin, unttii dagammii, meeshe be7eeza aazin yashitteeza.<verse eid="LUK 24:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>E unttiko, «Abis dagameenee? Abis sidhe yi wozinayid geleenee? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Ta kushannee ta toka bo7oytta; ta tana. Maakka aykkii bo7oytta; taal yi bi7izay garkk, meeshes ashonnee meqqethii baaya» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Yeegii, fa tokannee fa kusha unttan beezeeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>U ufayssapp dendeezayid ammanekkazar malabaz guussal yezin, Yesuusa unttiko, «Yhaydda yinttis miizibaz yenee?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>U xiqqa michintteez molo ezis inggeeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>E ekkii u tiinayid meeza.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>E, «Ta yinttar gam7eez wode ubbayid Muse higge maxaafitayid, nabitay maxaafitayidannee Mazmuure maxaafitayid, ta gisho xaafintteezibaz ubbitay polinttodayis beeziza yeegii ta yinttis odeez qaalay yhaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Ye wode Geeshsha Maxaafita akaakod garkk kaha unttis dooyeeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Yey garkkekka, «Kiristtoosa waaye ekkoda, hayidzantho qamma yhayiqopp dendoda yeegii xaafintteeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>Yerusalaameppe denddii as ubbayis nagaraypp maarotithaynne atotithi e sunthayir markkattoda. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Yi yeyis markkita. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Yeezako, taakka ta aday inggeez ufayssa yinttis dakkoda. Yi salopp wolqqa ma77od gatho Yerusalaame katama gam7oytta» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:4">Haw. O. 1:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa denddii salo qiteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mar. 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Haw. O. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Yeyppe guye, Bitaana katama unttan ekkii qiteeza. Fa kusha denthii anjjeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:50-51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Haw. O. 1:9-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Unttan anjjittar unttapp shaakinttii udee salo ekintteeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>U zuggii goynnii gaame ufayssar Yerusalaame maaqqeeza. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Xoossa ubba wode galatittar Xooss keetha gam7eeza.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
